<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- NUMAN</book>
  <para style="h">REV - NUMAN</para>
  <para style="toc1">REV - NUMAN</para>
  <para style="toc2">REV - NUMAN</para>
  <para style="toc3">REV - NUMAN</para>
  <para style="mt1">REV - NUMAN</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Mplɛ cɛr kǝŋe ayi iki yiŋ ndi Yesɔ Kristi nɛ tsari. Arik ne tsa ru ikiki suyir yi nyɛ ne ti te abɛ tsar igen amaa iki yiŋ ndi tei na azizaŋa. Kristi ne tsar igen amaa Yɔɔna ikiki yiŋɛ te shar ineshar ayou Arik ben abɔu, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />ankyak Yɔɔna ne bla bɔbɔk iki yiŋ ndi wa ne yige. Waŋa ai ilɛ kɛ bla maa keŋ ndi ire ben Arik ai ilɛ didik keŋ ndi Yesɔ Kristi ne bukɛ aglɛ rumɔ. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Anu adidik ayi bǝn iwaŋ ndi ne bu mplɛ kǝŋe atɔ, anu adidik ana yi bǝn waŋ ndi ne wɔ ilɛ kɛ ine shar ayou Arik te zǝ iki yiŋ ndi ne cɛrǝ ne mplɛ kǝŋɛ! Te mkpaŋ nǝ ka nyɛ ndi kiki yiŋɛ itei na bɔbɔk.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itek ire ben Yɔɔna te gar akabaŋkɔŋ amɛ taŋgba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Icɛr yiŋɛ ire bǝn Yɔɔna te gar bǝn nkun abɛ zi Arik amɛ taŋgba abɛ yi ne igar kɛ Asiya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Iki didik ben isik susun ire bǝn Arik te gar ben abɛ zhin, waŋ ndi ayi azizaŋ, ndi ne na yime kukub, waŋ ndi ate na nyɛ, bǝn izhu me taŋgba ndi iyi angus mben yi sɔŋ maa, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />te rɛ bǝn Yesɔ Kristi, waŋ ndi ayi ne bla ilɛ blabla didik, waŋ ndi ne kuti alu ne bɛ te na yi ne gli atum abɛ gɔŋmimi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Anyɛr ta, ne nek tu maa te ku te ta ta shur ne zumimin mɔr. <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />Te duŋ ta yi abɛ gli amaa bǝn abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik Tetɛɛ amaa. Ŋgɔŋ bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ bǝyi ben Yesɔ Kristi yaŋ klɛtu! Ibǝ yi amɛ.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Tɔ, anyɛ ne akpa! kɔte ŋɔwa atei yigu, te vuŋ abaŋ ndi ne turu ne kab. Bɔbɔk ntun yi igɔŋmimi atei zhin ne atu amaa. Fe itei yi amɛ! <verse eid="REV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Arik Ngɔŋ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ adi &lt;&lt;Nga myi kuti ben klɛtu,&gt;&gt; waŋ ndi ayime azizaŋa, ai wa ayi ne yi kukub, waŋ ndi atei nyɛ.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itɔ ti iyi Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Ai nga Yɔɔna, izumin, ikpa min ne zi Yesɔ ne vuŋ susun ne iyah iyiŋ ndi iye ben abaŋ ndi ayi ne kɔb Arik. Ne nyak me ne ve gɔŋmimi kɛ atsutsu amashir ndi azhɔk te Batamusa te mne du ilɛ kɛ Arik tena bla ilɛ didik keŋ ndi Yesɔ gli kɛ arumɔ. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Ne bɛr yi ben Arik Izhu ne glim, ankyak mwɔ ikɔr ngɔŋ, iglɔ ndi mpluŋ, ilɛ ne igɔŋ muŋ. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Ikɔrɔ di, &lt;&lt;Cɛr iki yiŋ ndi une yige, tɛna shar mplɛ cɛr gar ne Akabaŋkɔŋ ndi ayi ne ntuntun me taŋgba: Afisa, Simirna, Birgama, Tayatira, Sardisu, Filadefiya, ben Laudikiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />M kamtɔ te mbǝyik ayi ŋɔwa alɛ ben abɛm, fe myik iki sak lu yi Zinariya ime taŋgba, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />ne atsutsu amene ikinuŋ klikli ndi ineshir, ne su iki ndi tɔm tar ne aza, ne aku asa maa ne lak kɛ ne zinariya. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Mfumfuktu maa iklak ndi aruru, ayi amaa ayi ndi lǝlɛn ilu; <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />aza maa alaŋ ndi izɔb keŋ ndi ne ren kɛ te kin kɛ anyɛ, ikɔr maa iglɔ ndi amashir ane gbub ngɔŋ. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Agli Icinces me taŋgba ne ŋɔk li maa, anzi gba akɛ li agara yaa aru are anu amaa. Iti maa ilaŋ ndi arik atsutsu. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Ndi mne yigu me zhaku ne aza maa ndi ikum ineshir. Ne sak ŋɔk li ma ne atɔ amuŋ tedi, &lt;&lt;Duŋ klu sisik ba! Nga myi ne kuti ben klɛtu. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Me yi tsitsir! Mne ku, ama azizaŋa Me yi tsitsir gar klɛtu. Me yi ne iki bu ankɔŋ ne atu yi ku ben Igɔŋmimi kɛ ku. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Neme, ubǝ cɛr iki yiŋ ndi une yige, iki yiŋ ndi yi azǝzaŋa ben iki yiŋ ndi tei na ne ti. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Tɔ ikiki yi suyir yi cinces taŋgba ndi une yige ne ŋɔk li i muŋ, ben kiki yi laŋ lu me taŋgba: Icinces me taŋgba yiŋɛ ai abɛ shar ayou Arik abɛ Akabaŋkɔŋ amɛ taŋgba, iki yi laŋ lu me taŋgba yiŋɛ ai Akabaŋkɔŋ amɛ taŋgba.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Ishar yi gar ben abɛ zi Arik ne Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />&lt;&lt;Ube cɛr ne shar ayou Arik ndi ayi ben abɛ zǝ Arik ndi ayi ne Afisa: &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi ishar yiŋ ndi ire ben waŋ ndi agli cinces me taŋgba ne ŋɔk li maa te ana tsǝn ne atsutsu akɛ iki yi sak laŋ lu me taŋgba. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Mǝne zhi iki yiŋ ndi une nai; Mǝne zhi ir keŋ ndi ne tsi kli ben ir keŋ ndi une vuŋ susun. Mǝne zhi bau te tanyɛmɛ ben abɛ na zumimin ba ben ir keŋ ndi izhin ne tsar abaŋ ndi adi aba yi abɛ du lɛ kɛ Arik ama ba yi amɛ ba, ayi abɛ timu. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Uyi ne vuŋ susun, une yik iyah ne atu muŋ, bau ne dǝk ba. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Ama mne nǝgu la lɛ ne iki yiŋ: bau ne nyɛr me ndi ikuti ba. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Ubɛ lɛ ne susun tɔ ndi une ŋurkam angɔŋgɔŋ! Ubɛ duŋ na zumimin te na iki yiŋ ndi une nai ne kuti. Bau te duŋ na zumimin ba, Me tei nyɛ ben abɔu te Mbaŋ ilu kɛ laŋ mi yaru ma. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Ama ne yiŋɛ une na didik: une kyak iki yiŋ ndi Nikɔlatawa anai, Nga muŋ yi mkyak yi. <verse eid="REV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />&lt;&lt;Utǝ yi ne atɔŋ, ubɛ wɔ iki yiŋ ndi Izhu ibla abɛ zǝ Arik neyi! &lt;&lt;Abaŋ ndi ne lieru mtei duŋ ba ama idɔ kuŋkun kɛ nek ivli ndi ne tɔ ne ahwaŋ ayi Arik.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishar yi gar abɛ zǝ Arik ne Simirna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />&lt;&lt;Ubǝ cɛr ne shar ayou Arik ndi ayi ne Simirna: &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi shar ndi ire ben iwaŋ ndi wa ayi ne kuti ben ne klɛtu, waŋ ndi ne kuh tena yime tsitsir. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Mne zhi iya iyiŋ ndi uyigǝ; Mne zhi uyi ne yaŋ ki, ama uyi ne adudunki! Mne zhi ilɛ mimin keŋ ndi a bla kɛ ne atu mi ire bǝn abaŋ ndi adi aba ayi Yahudawa ama ba yi amɛ ba; ai tsǝn aneshir abaŋ ndi ayi abɛ ishetan! <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Kǝr bɛ te sisik iyah yiŋ ndi utei yige. Uwɔ ni! shetan te sak zhin iyah te duŋ avu anuŋ ashur ne jaru, izhin tei yik iber wur. Ubǝ vuŋ susun Gli ne atu amuŋ, kɔ te di atei ŋunu, mtei nǝgu ivli kɛ dǝk kɛ lieru mi. <verse eid="REV 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Waŋ ndi ate yi ne atɔŋ, abɛ wɔ iki yiŋ ndi Izhu ibla abɛ zǝ Arik! &lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ate lieru iku kɛ yaa batei vuŋɔ ba.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishar iyi gar ben abɛ zǝ Arik ne Birgama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />&lt;&lt;Ubǝ cɛr ine shar ayou Arik ndi ayi ne Birgama te di: &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi shar ndi ire ben waŋ ndi ayi anzi gba akɛ li agar ayaa. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Mne zhi amkpa awaŋ ndi usɔŋɔ, ayi amkpa awaŋ ndi Iben yi shetan iyime. Une kli mgbamgbaŋ ben abɛm, bau ne duŋ tanyɛme bene abɛm ba ne mkpaŋ keŋ ndi Antibas, ne bla ilɛ muŋ anenen, ndi ne ŋunu ne amkpa waŋ ndi shetan isɔŋɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Ama mǝne nugu lalɛ ne muɔ kiki nuŋ: anuŋ ne miŋ min azǝ itsar yi Balaam, ndi ne tsar Balak ankɔŋ awaŋ ndi atei gbur Isrela asur ne na zumimin te lom ba te duŋ ali ikili yiŋ ndi ne na mkpɔk kuŋkun neyi te na duŋ ba akur ben amba abaŋ ndi ba yi amen ba. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Ne ankɔŋ azhin awaŋa anuŋ ne miŋ min azǝ itsar yi Nikɔlatawa. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Neme izhin bǝ duŋ na zumimin min! Mba zhin te duŋ ba, M tei nyɛ ben abɛ zhin andanda te te ikum ben aneshir abaŋa ne anzi gba ndi aru are anu amuŋ. <verse eid="REV 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />&lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ayi ne atɔŋ, abɛ wɔ iki yiŋ ndi Izhu ibla abɛ zǝ Arik! &lt;&lt;Te abaŋ ndi ne li aru mtei nek ba manna keŋ ndi ne suyir. Mtei na nek kɔte ŋɔwa mkpaŋ klikla yiŋ ndi ne cɛr sak yayas keŋ ndi ba nuŋ ne zhi kɛ ba, se waŋ ndi ne ta yi.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishar yi gar ben abɛ zǝ Arik ne Tayatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />Ubǝ cɛr ne shar ayou Arik ndi ayi ne Akabaŋkɔŋ ane Tayatira te di: &lt;&lt;Waŋ ayi ishar ndi ire ben Izu Arik, waŋ ndi ayi amaa awu ndi lǝlɛn ilu, aza maa ayi glaŋglaŋ ndi mkpaŋ yiŋ ndi ne kɔi. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Mǝne zhi kiki yi na mi. Mǝne zhi nyɛr mi, mǝne zhi ina didik mi, ina ndum mi, ben vuŋ susun mi. Mǝne zhi ikiki yi na mi azizaŋa inaŋ yi kuti. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Ama mǝne nugu lalɛ ne kiki yiŋ: une vuŋ susun ben iwa waŋa ndi azhɔu te Jezebɛl, ndi azho tu maa igen ayou Arik. Itsar maa ne cɔk agɛn amuŋ te duŋ ba ate bubu tiŋ te na li ikili yiŋ ndi ne na kpok kuŋkun nayi. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Mǝne nugu nkpaŋ te abɛ duŋ zumimin maa, ama ne kyak duŋ zumimin maa yi zǝ alulum. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Neme M tei tugu zhɔk ne ki kur ndi wa ben abaŋ ndi ne kur ben abɔu atei yik iyah ngɔŋ. Mtei na amɛ azizaŋa se ate yi ndi ne duŋ na zumimin yiŋ ndi ne nai ben abɔu. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Mtei na ŋlɔk abaŋ ndi azeu, neme abɛ zǝ Arik bɔbɔk atei zhi te di mne zhi ilɛ kɛ susun ben iki wɔb aneshir bɔbɔk. Mtei nek aneshir bɔbɔk idǝk kɛ iki yiŋ ndi ne nai. <verse eid="REV 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />&lt;&lt;Ama nki min ndi ayi ne Tayatira ndi ba ne zǝ itsar mimin yiŋɛ ba; ba tei zhi iki yiŋ ndi anuŋ azhɔi te &lt;iki yi suyir iyi shetan.&gt; Mǝne di zhin bam tei nek zhin ihru kɛ luk ba. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Ama izhin bǝ Gli iki yiŋ ndi izhin yime neyi gbamgbaŋ, se Mne nyɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Teyi abaŋ ndi ne yik lieru, ndi azǝ iki yi wɔb muŋ gar klɛtu, Mtei nek ba mgbyamgbyaŋ keŋ ndi mǝne ta kɛ rɛ ben Tetɛɛ: <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Mtei nǝk ba mgbyamgbyaŋ ne atu ayi aneshir, tǝ abɛ gli ba nkpɔk ki kɛ zɔb te na tsik ba amlik amkpɔmkpɔk ndi mkpalin yi na ne mimi. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Mtei na nek ba ncinces yi amblimblɛ.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Iwaŋ ndi ayi ne atɔŋ, abɛ wɔ iki yiŋ ndi Izhu ibla abɛ zǝ Arik ne yi!<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Ishar yi gar ben abɛ zǝ Arik ne Sardisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />Ubǝ cɛr ne shar ayou Arik ndi ayi bǝn abǝ zǝ Arik nǝ Sardisu te di: &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi shar ndi ire bǝn waŋ ndi ayi ne Izhu me taŋgba yi Arik bǝn cinces me taŋgba. Mne zhi iki yiŋ ndi unai; Mnǝ zhi te kɔte adi uyi tsitsir ne tanyɛmɛ amɛ ama uyi kum! <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Neme ubǝ shur ayi, ubǝ tyak sǝ te gli iki yiŋ ndi uyime neyi igligli didik tǝ kǝr ibǝ ku dɔ bɔbɔk ba. Te mne yik iki yiŋ ndi unai ba yi anenen nǝ ti kɛ Arik amuŋ ba. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Neme ubǝ shuzhi iki yiŋ ndi ne tsa ru te wɔi; ubǝ zei te duŋ zumimin mi. Bau te shur ayi ba, mtei nyɛ ndi ner ne zhib, bau tei zhi mkpaŋ keŋ ndi mtei nyɛ ba. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Ama anuŋ ne Sardisu ayime ndi ne duŋ kluŋklu mi yi tsetser. Utei tsin ben abɛm, atei suu kluŋklu klikla, te une mla abɛ suu ayi. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Abaŋ ndi ne lieru atei su ba kluŋklu klikla, ba tei atun asak amen atibe ne mplɛ kǝ abɛ vli ba. Nǝ ti kɛ Tetɛɛ amuŋ ben abɛ shar amaa mtei mbla ndende te ndi uyi bǝn abɛm. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />&lt;&lt;Utǝ yi ne atɔŋ, ubǝ wɔ iki yiŋ ndi Izhu iblaa abɛ zǝ Arik!<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishar yi gar bǝn abǝ zǝ Arik nǝ Filadefiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />Ubǝ cɛr ne shar ayou Arik ndi ayi bǝn abǝ zǝ Arik ne Filadefiya te di: &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi shar yiŋ ndi ire ben waŋ ndi ayi tsetser tena yi nǝ zub. Ayi ne iki bu ankɔŋ ne amkpa awaŋ ndi Doda agliu, ndi ate abu ankɔŋ, bane ku ayime ba, ate buu bane ku ayime ba. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Mne zhi iki yiŋ ndi unai; mne zhi te iyi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ watsɔb; une zǝ itsar muŋ tena nam zub. Mne bu ankɔŋɔ ne ti mi, ndi bane ku ayime ba. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Ubǝ wɔ! Atei ntsan aneshir abaŋ ndi ayi ben shetan, tena timu te di aba ayi ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ama ba yi amɛ ba, mtei duŋ anyɛ te zekur ne aza mi. Bɔbɔk mǝne atei zhi tedi me nye ru. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Tǝ une zǝ ilɛ kɛ kpa nyak muŋ tena vuŋ kpa Gli, Mtei na ku nyak ne mkpaŋ kɛ yik iyah tǝ nɛ vuŋ susun ndi sɔŋ nyɛ ne atu yi gɔŋmimi te abɛ tsar aneshir abɛ gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />M nye andanda. Ubǝ gli iki yiŋ ndi uyime neyi gbamgbaŋ, te kǝr nuŋ abɛ cogu ata idǝk kɛ lieru mi ba. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Me tei duŋ abaŋ ndi ne lieru abɛyi kukɔŋ ne Akabaŋkɔŋ ayi Arik amuŋ, batei na duŋu ba. Me ntei cɛr isak kɛ Arik muŋ netu amene isak kɛ ntun iyi Arik amuŋ, Urshelima yayas, ndi atei zi are gbarshu ire ben Arik. Me ntei na cɛr isak muŋ yayas aneyi. <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />&lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ate yi ne atɔŋ, abɛ wɔ iki yiŋ ndi Izhu bla abǝ zǝ Arik!<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishar yi gar bǝn abe zɛ Arik ne Laudikiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />Ubǝ cɛr ne shar ayou Arik ndi yi bǝn abɛ zǝ Arik nǝ Laudikiya te di: &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi shar ndi ire bǝn waŋ ndi isak maa iyi amɛ, inǝ na anenen bǝn ne bla zub, waŋ ndi aye Arik wa ne na kiki bɔbɔk ne gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Me ne zhi iki yiŋ ndi unǝ nai; Mne zhi tǝ ndi bau sik ba bau ŋurwu ba. Iwɔb muŋ ubǝ yi izhiin kɔ bɛ sik kɔ bǝ ŋur wu! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Ama uyi ne atsutsu, bau ŋurwu ba bau sik ba, Me tei rugu tyak zhɔk ne anu amuŋ! <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Udi, &lt;Me yi nǝ adudunki tena yi nǝ kiki bɔbɔk ndi me wɔ bǝ.&gt; Ama bau ne zhi tedi uyi nǝ yaŋ ki ba bǝn nǝ lɔ susun! Uyi nǝ yaŋ ki, mgbawun, bǝn amfik. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Neme, me nǝgu ilɛ, ubǝ lɛb zineriya bǝn abɛm, ayiŋ ndi aye nii, tǝ ubɛ yi ne adudunki. Ubǝ na lɛb anklu aklikla bǝn abɛm te su iku ishisha mgbawun mi. Tǝ na lɛb anyɛ ishur ne ayi ami, tǝ ubɛ yik. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Me vǝ tena nǝk iwaŋ ndi me nye ru iyah. Neme ubɛ na didik, te duŋ na zumimin mi. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Wɔ! Me kɛ nkli ne anɔkɔŋ te kpaŋu; iwaŋ ndi ate wɔ ikɔr muŋ te bu ankɔŋɔ, Me ntei nyɛ ikɔb men te li ikili bǝn abɛba, aba menyi atei li ikili bǝn abɛm. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Te yi abaŋ ndi ne lieru Me ntei nǝk ba ankɔŋ ane sɔŋ bǝn kɔnsa muŋ nǝ kɔb muŋ, ir keŋ ndi mǝne lieru te azizaŋa me ku sɔŋ nǝ ŋok li ben Tetɛɛ amuŋ ne mbɛn maa. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />&lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi atei yi ne atɔŋ, abɛ wɔ iki yiŋ ndi Izhu ibla abɛ zǝ Arik!<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Izikur ne Gbarshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Neme me ni yik iki yi sɔŋ nyɛ ne ti men anɔkɔŋ ne bu ne gbarshu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:1">Ikɔr keŋ ndi mǝne wɔ kɛ ndi ne lɛ ben abɛm ne kuti, ne glɔ ndi mpluŋ, idi, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ ayaŋ, te mtei tsa ru iki yiŋ ndi itei na ndi yiŋɛ te gayir.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Ne mkpaŋ zhiin Izhu ne glim. Ankyak me yik iner nuŋ akɔsɔŋ ne mbɛn yi tum ne gbarshu. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Iti maa ilaŋ klaklak ndi mkpaŋ yasfa bǝn yakutu, adar ayi ndi zumurudu ne gɔŋ mbene ari. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Mben me sɔkyaa anǝ nas ne gɔŋ mben yi Itu mɔ iri, anuŋkub aneshir amɛ sɔkyaa ane nas ne suu kluŋklu klikla tena su itu anku kɛ yi ndi zinariya te akɔ sɔŋ akamu azik Mben yi Itum agɔŋ ari. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Nǝ mbene ilu laŋ, iglɔ ikiki, ben inas. Nǝ ti kɛ Mbene ilulu me taŋgba izǝn ta, ndi ayi Izhu me taŋgba yi Arik. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Ina yemɛ ti kɛ mben yi Itu mɔ ikinuŋ ndi amplɛ mkpaŋ yi laŋ yi nǝk, iyi ndi iki tɔ ti. kɔte nkɔn sa takǝ ikǝ mbene, kiki yi vli ndi yi ne ayi ne kpa mǝne bɔbɔk me nas ne gɔŋ kɛ iri. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Ine kuti me ayi ndi Ici; inǝ yaa ayi ndi nklu; inǝ ntar ma iti maa yi ndi iti neshir; inǝ nas ma ayi ndi agamdi azǝn bwak. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Ikiki yi vli me nas yiŋɛ kɔte tayi iyi nɛ amgba amɛ tani, ana yi ne ayi ndi agɔŋ ari ne miŋ bǝn abɛm. Aduk asem aririk bǝn bu yaŋ gburkli tedi: Tsetser,tsetser, tsetser, Arik Ŋgɔŋ ne yaŋ klɛtu, Iwaŋ ndi ne yime kukub, tena yime azizaŋ, waŋ ndi atei na nyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Ikiki yi vli me nas yiŋɛ iduk asesem iyi nek ŋgɔŋ ben nyɛr iwaŋ ndi akɔsɔŋ ne mben yi Itum, iwaŋ ndi ba yi ne klɛtu ba. Te na amɛ, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />anuŋkub aneshir amɛ sɔkyaa ane nas abaŋa azeku ne mimi ne ti kɛ iwaŋ ndi akɔsɔŋ ne mben yi Itum, te zekuu iwaŋ ndi ba yi ne klɛtu ba. Atun tu anku men atyak azhɔk ne ti kɛ mben yi Itu mɔ te di, <verse eid="REV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />&lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ amɔr ben Arik! Une mla te ubɛ ta ŋgɔŋ, gbar bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ. Te ayi wa ne na kiki bɔbɔk, ne tanyɛme mi kiki yiŋɛ ne yime te yi ne vli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Ilɛ kɛ Arik ben Ivǝn Nklu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Mne yik Mplɛ kɛ cɛr ne ŋɔk li kɛ waŋ ndi akɔ sɔŋ ne mbɛn yi tum; ne ku icɛre ne akɔnɔsa bɔbɔk tena sak ngir amɛ ataŋgba. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Mne na yik ŋgɔŋ nuŋ ine shar ayou Arik, waŋ ndi ne du kɛ ne kɔr ngɔŋ te di, &lt;&lt;Iŋɔwa nɛ mla nǝ zuk ngir tǝ bu mplɛ kɛ cɛr kǝŋei?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Ama bane yik inuŋ ne igɔŋmimi ben igbarshu ka ne shin igɔŋmimi ndi ne mla ne bu kɛ te bɛ atɔ miŋe. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Mne zhin gbɔmgbɔŋ te bam nǝ mla nǝ bu icɛre te tɔ imiŋe ba. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Ankyak izhiin nǝ miŋ kɛ anuŋkubɔ adim te di, &lt;&lt;Duŋ zhin ka. Tɔ! Ici ne rɛ nga ŋli kǝ Yahuza, ngɔŋ ne nga ŋli kɛ Doda, nɛ li ikum, ne mla ne bu icɛre ben ngir me taŋgba ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Fe Mnǝ na yik Nklu aklɛkli ne atsutsu akǝ mben yi tu mɔ, ikiki yi vli me nas bǝn anuŋkub te kam mbene agɔŋɔri. Nklu mɔ ne ru aklɛ ndi ne ka men aŋunu. Ayi ne njunju ime taŋgba bǝn ayi amɛ taŋgba, waŋa ayi izhu ime taŋgba iye Arik ndi ne sha ru ne gɔŋmimi bɔbɔk. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Nklu mɔ ne gar te akɔte ta icɛre nǝ ŋɔk li kǝ waŋ ndi akɔsɔŋ nǝ mben yi tu mɔ. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Ndi ne na amɛ, ikiki yi vli bǝn anuŋkub sɔkyaa anǝ nas azǝ aku Nklu mɔ. kɔte tawa ayi nǝ mpluŋ bǝn agbǝgba ane zinariya ishak anyɛ anǝ yemgbo shushum, ndi ben yi aneshir abe Arik. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Aduk asem ayayas tedi: &lt;&lt;Unǝ mla nǝ baŋ mplɛ cɛrǝ te zuk ngire. Tǝ ne ŋunu, ama unǝ nek tu mi tǝ ku te lɛb Arik aneshir ire kɔte nga ŋli takɛ, aŋa, bǝn ntun tayi, bǝn aneshir abǝ gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="REV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Unǝ kam ba te abɛyi abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik amɔr, te bɛ Gli gɔŋmimi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Fena Mne na ntɔ, te na wɔ okɔr abɛ shar ayou Arik, atetɛk! Aklɛkli agɔŋɔri nǝ mben yi Tum, ikiki yi vli ime nas, bǝn anuŋkub aneshire, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />te duk asem ne kɔr ngɔŋ tedi: &lt;&lt;Nklu waŋ ndi ane ŋunu ne mla ne ta mgbyamgbyaŋ, adudunki, mgbemgbeb, iklik, ngɔŋ, bǝn gbar asak!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Ankyak fe Me wɔ kɔte iki yiŋ ndi Arik ne nai ndi iyi nǝ gbarshu, bǝn mimi, bǝn gɔŋmimi, bǝn inǝk ngɔŋ, bǝn kiki bɔbɔk yi vli ndi iyi nǝ gɔŋmimi aduk asem te di: &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi akɔsɔŋ nǝ mben yi Tum bǝn Nklu mɔ, igbar asak, ngɔŋ, bǝn nek ngɔŋ, ibǝyi mi iyaŋ klɛtu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Ikiki yi vli me nas ma itanyɛme tǝ di, &lt;&lt;Bǝ yi amɛ!&gt;&gt; Ankyak anuŋkub neshir sɔkyaa anǝ nas maa azekur.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Angire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Ankyak Myik Nklu mɔ abu ngir izhiin ne min kɛ angir me taŋgba ma, fe Mwɔ izhiin nǝ miŋ kɛ kiki me nas yi vli me alɛ ne kɔr ndi ira nas tedi, Nyɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Mtɔ, te yik ŋa klikla. Iwaŋ ndi asɔŋ sau ma agli tǝ ta, ne nǝgu itu. Ne sau te ru ndi ine li kum te agar li kum. <verse eid="REV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Fe Nklu mɔ ana bu ngir kɛ yaa; ankyak Mwɔ ikɔr iki yi vli ikǝ yaa idi, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Iŋa nuŋ aru, ayi sesen. Iwaŋ ndi asau ma ne nǝgu mgbyamgbyaŋ tǝ abɛ gli ikum anyɛ me nǝ gɔŋmimi, te aneshir abɛ ŋlɔk akpa amen. Ne nǝgu anzigba angɔŋ. <verse eid="REV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Ankyak Nklu mɔ ana bu ngir ikɛ ntar; fena Mna wɔ iki yi vli yi ntar idi, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ!&gt;&gt; Mtɔ, te yik Iŋa shishir. Ine sau ma agli agbǝgba ne tsar ki ne ŋɔk maa. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Fe Me wɔ ikinuŋ ndi ikɔr ru rɛ imiŋ kɛ ikiki yi vli me nas ma, te di, &lt;&lt;Alikama mudu ayi dǝk kɛ ndum bar zhiin, mudu tar yi shayil dǝk kɛ ndum kɛ bar zhiin. Ama kǝr ubǝ cɔk anyɛ ben ama idɔ inabi la ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Fe Nklu ma ana bu ngir ikɛ nas ma; ankyak mǝna wɔ iki yi vli yi nas idi, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Mtɔ, fe te yik iŋa dindilim. Ine sau ma azhɔu te Iku, fe Hades ize gɔŋ maa. Ne nek ba mgbyamgbyaŋ ne atu ayi ntǝk kǝ nas ike aner abɛ gɔŋmimi, abɛ ŋlɔk aneshir ne kum, ben ijɔŋ, ilɔ, ben inarum ngɔŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="REV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Ankyak Nklu mɔ abu ngir kɛ ntun. Myik ne angus amkpa nǝ tsik ibaŋ te yik asusun aneshir abaŋ ndi ne ŋlɔk ba ne atu yi du ilɛ kɛ Arik ndi nena bla kɛ anenen. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Ne ŋar ikɔr ngɔŋ tedi, &lt;&lt;Arik Ŋgɔŋ, ine yi tsetser ben zub! Aye atentai utei ka shi tǝ aneshir abɛ gɔŋmimi ŋas tǝ nek ba iyah ne atu ayi ŋlɔk tei?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Ne nek kɔte ŋɔwa ne min mǝne anklu aklikla, te di ba abɛ bǝne sɔŋ asik nɛ liŋ, se aki amunzumen, abaŋ ndi atei ŋlɔk ba ne te, ndi ne ŋlɔk ba menyi. <verse eid="REV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Fe Myik Nklu mɔ abu ngir ikɛ tani. Imimi ne jaŋ ngɔŋ, arik ne kama te ashishir ndi ŋa anklu shishir akǝ yi nǝ mfumfuk, ankyak ihwa ne kam te sesen ndi azhizhi. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Icinces ne rik hrie ne mimi, ndi idɔ ibwab ŋiŋin izu ihrie ndi nguŋgu ngɔŋ ne fugǝ. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Akpa ne naŋ adɔ ndi ngir kɛ ŋyen agurhwa, ankyak kɔte igbu tayi bǝn agaŋkubgbu atawa nɛ sɛrǝ atibe ne amkpa ne kli amaa. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Fe atum abɛ gɔŋmimi, bǝn abɛ gli gɔŋmimi, angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ kpaakpa, abɛ yi nɛ adudunki bǝn abǝ yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ, bǝn aneshir bɔbɔk, bǝn agɛn bǝn abaŋ ndi bai agɛn ba, ne su atu men ayir ne ayo mkpaŋ nǝ igbu. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Azhɔ igbu ben mkpaŋ, te di &lt;&lt;Zhaku zhin ne atu amɔr te su ta yir ne ayi waŋ ndi akɔ sɔŋ nǝ mben yi Itum bǝn mfu kǝ Nklu mɔ! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Iber ngɔŋ yi te mfu imen nǝ nyɛ, iŋɔwa ne mla nǝ vuŋ susun tɛ kli?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Aner abǝ Isrela amɛ 144,000 ne sak ba ngir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Ndi iyiŋɛ nǝ gayir Myik abǝ bla shar Arik amɛ anas aklɛkli nǝ ŋguŋgu nas iyi gɔŋmimi, akam agli amgba amɛ anas ma te yar ŋguŋgu tǝ kǝr abe duŋ fuk gɔŋmimi kɔ nǝk ngɔŋ kɔ atiŋe kuŋkun. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Fe Mtara yik inǝ bla shar ayou Arik nuŋ aru are gar kɛ anzaŋ, te gli ngir kɛ Arik tsitsir. Azhɔ abǝ bla ishar Arik amɛ nas ne kɔr ngɔŋ tǝ ne nǝk ba mgbyamgbyaŋ tǝ bɛ cɔk gɔŋmimi bǝn Inǝk ngɔŋ ala. <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />Inǝ bla shar ayou Arik adi,&lt;&lt;Duŋ cɔk gɔŋmimi kɔ Inǝk ngɔŋ kɔ iye atiŋe kuŋkun la ba sɛ tane sak ngir ne anuti iye agɛn abɛ Arik amɔr.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Fena Mwɔ idu aner abaŋ ndi ne asak ba ngire ne ati amen: 144,000 ibaŋ rɛ aŋa abǝ Isrela, <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Ire ŋli nga kɛ Yahuda 12,000 ne sak ba ngir,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">Ire ŋli nga kǝ Ruben 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">Ire ŋli kǝ Gad 12,000,<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />Ire ŋli kǝ Asha 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">Ire ŋli kǝ Naftali 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">Ire ŋli kǝ Manase 12,000, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />ire ŋli kǝ Siman 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">Ire ŋli kǝ Levi 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">Ire ŋli kǝ Isaka 12,000,<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="lim1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />Ire ŋli kǝ Zebulu 12,000,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:8">Ire ŋli kǝ Yusuu 12,000,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 7:8">Ire ŋli kǝ Banyami 12,000.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntsan anɛshire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Ndi iyiŋɛ nǝ gayir Mtɔ, fe te yik ntsan aneshir ndi inuŋ bai blaa ba aklɛ ba, ire kɔte ntun tayi, nga, aner, bǝn aŋa, aklɛkli ne ti kɛ mben ngɔŋ bǝn iti kɛ Nklu. Ne duŋ nǝ kluŋklu klikla te agli ayiya lik nɛ aŋɔk amɛn. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Te aŋar akɔr amen ngɔŋ: &lt;&lt;Ita zhɔk iyi bǝn Arik amɔr, iwaŋ ndi akɔsɔŋ nǝ mben ngɔŋ, bǝn Nklu mɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Abǝ bla ishar Arik bɔbɔk ne kam mben ngɔŋɔ azhɔk ne tsutsu bǝn angɔŋgɔŋ bǝn kiki me nas iyi vli me. azeku nǝti kǝ mben ngɔŋɔ te agbar Arik, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />tedi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">&lt;&lt;Bǝ yi amɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Igbar bǝn nek ngɔŋ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Bǝn mgbemgbebɛ bǝn nyɛr ŋgɔŋ bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ bǝn iklik</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Bǝyi bun Arik amɔr ne yaŋ klɛtu bǝn iyaŋ klɛtu.<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Ankyak izhiin nǝ miŋ kɛ acicɛ me arib me, &lt;&lt;Abaŋ ndi asu kluŋklu klikla ma ayi anǝ ŋɔ bai, te ana rɛ amei?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />&lt;&lt;Bam nǝ zhi ba, ŋgɔŋ. unǝ zhi,&gt;&gt; M sagu ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Fe adim, &lt;&lt;Abaŋa aye aneshir ndi ne alieru nǝ min kɛ iyik iyah ngɔŋ. Ne ŋla kluŋklu men te duŋǝ iyi klikla ne azhizhi ayou Nklu. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Waŋa ai ki yiŋ ndi ne duŋ ba akli ne ti kɛ mben ngɔŋ iye Arik te zekuru aririk ben ibu ne Akabaŋkɔŋ amaa. Iwaŋ ndi akɔsɔŋ ne mbene atei ŋub ba ne yime maa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">&lt;&lt;Ayi ne ti kɛ mben ngɔŋ iye Arik</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">Te gbaru aririk ben ibu ne akaba amaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">Fe iwaŋ ndi akɔsɔŋ ne mben ŋgɔŋɔ atei ŋub ba ne yime maa. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Ikasa ba iteina vuŋ ba kɔ ihrie ba; Ilaŋ arik batei vuŋ ba, kɔ abɛm wu, <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />te Nklu, iwaŋ ndi ayi ne atsutsu akɛ mben ngɔŋɔ, atei yi ne kyu ba, iwa atei gli ba te agar lelɔ ngyak tuk tsitsir kɛ yaŋ gbur. Tǝ Arik atei yis ba kɔte amayi atawa neyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ngir ikɛ taŋgba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Ndi Nklu mɔ ne bu ngir kɛ taŋgba, amkpa ne tǝ gum nǝ shu iyar minti sɔktar.<verse eid="REV 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Fe Mne yik abɛ bla shar Arik amɛ ataŋgba ma aklɛkli ne ti kɛ Arik, ankyak ne nǝk ba mpluŋ me taŋgba.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Ine bla shar Arik nuŋ, iwaŋ ndi agli ŋaatsa ndi ne nakǝ nǝ zineriya akɛ shur aŋkliŋkla lu ayi ntsiŋ, anyɛ kli ne bagedi. Ne nǝgu mbumbur ki shushum iyi shur ne aŋkliŋklalu tetɛk iyi gɔŋ te ben aneshir Arik te gɔŋǝ ne min amkpa anǝ tsik ibaŋ ndi ne nau nǝ zineriya tɛ aklɛkli ne ti kɛ mben ngɔŋɔ. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Ntsiŋ iyi gɔŋ mbumbur ki shushumɔ ilu nab kɔmɔ ne shu bǝn Iben Arik iye aneshir ne aŋɔk ayi ne bla shar Arik ndi aklɛkli ne ti kɛ Arik. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Ankyak inǝ bla shar Arik abaŋ ŋaatsa akǝ shur mbumbur ki shushumɔ, ashur aŋkliŋklalu ne bagedime, te tuge ashur ne gɔŋmimi. Ankyak ŋguŋgu ben ili nas, bǝn izhaŋ gɔŋmimi.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpluŋ me taŋgba ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Fe abɛ bla shar Arik amɛ ataŋgba ma ndi agli mpluŋ anakli iyi tei vlǝi.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Ine shar bla ilɛ kɛ Arik ine kuti avli mpluŋ maa. Mkpaŋ alu ben ilu ibiŋ ne azhizhi, fe atugǝ ashur ne gɔŋmimi. Ntǝk kɛ ntar kɛ gɔŋmimi ne gɔŋ, ntǝk kɛ ntar kɛ kuŋkun ne gɔŋ, ben agǝga ashushu ne gɔŋ.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Inǝ bla ishar Arik ine yaa ne vli mpluŋ maa. Ikinuŋ yiŋɛ iyi ndi igbu ngɔŋ tena tɔm te ta lu a tyagǝ azhɔk ne Inǝk ngɔŋ. Ntǝk kǝ ntar kǝ Inǝk ngɔŋɔ ikam tǝ azhizhi, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />ntǝk kɛ ntar iyi vli ndi iyi ne miŋ Inǝk ngɔŋɔ ne ku, bǝn ntǝk kɛ ntar iyi igu ngɔŋgɔŋ iye inege ne shuri adɔmɔ.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Ankyak ine bla shar Arik ine ntar ne vli mpluŋ maa. Ncinces ngɔŋ, igɔŋ ndi lilɛn lu, izhaku ire shu te ku ne ntǝk kɛ ntar kɛ inǝk bǝn mgbashe ayi yaŋ gbur amashir. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />(Isak kɛ ncincese azhɔkǝ te &lt;&lt;Ilik&gt;&gt;) Ntǝk kɛ ntar kɛ amashire ikam lik, fena aneshir tetɛk abɛ so amashire ne ku, te amashire ne akama alik.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Fe ine bla shar Arik ne nas avli mpluŋ maa. Ntǝk kɛ ntar kɛ laŋ arik, ntǝk kɛ ntar kǝ hwa, bǝn ntǝk kǝ ntar kǝ ncinces, ilaŋ mǝne itei zi nyak ntǝk ki ntar ne yaŋ laŋ; Amkpa ba tei laŋ ba ne ntǝk kɛ ntar kɛ aririk ben ntǝk kɛ ntar ikɛ bu maayi.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Fena Mnǝ ntɔ, te wɔ agamdi ndi azǝn bwak gbagbaŋ nǝ shu adi ne kɔr ngɔŋ, &lt;&lt;Wɔ zhin iki mimin tei nyɛ gɔŋmimi! Ba tei men ba netu aye aneshir abǝ yi ne gɔŋmimi ndi ate wɔ vli mpluŋ kǝ nki abǝ bla shar Arik amɛ tar ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Ankyak inǝ bla shar Arik nǝ ntun avli mpluŋ maa. Fe Myik ncinces ire shu tǝ zhaku nǝ gɔŋmimi, tǝ nɛ nǝgu iki bu ankɔŋ anǝ dudu lǝlɛ kǝ yaŋ klɛtu kɛ abǝ ŋlɔk aneshir. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Ncincese ne bu dudumɔ, fe ntsiŋ irurɛ miŋɛ, ndi ntsiŋ yi rɛ imiŋ lu ngɔŋ; ilaŋ arik bǝn shu ikam tǝ ibu ne ntsiŋ yi rurɛ dudu kɛ yaŋ klɛtu. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Adamgbyaŋ aru are min kǝ ntsiŋe te anyɛ gɔŋmimi, fena ne nǝk ba mgbyamgbyaŋ ir zhiin ndi kɛ anǝlaŋ. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Ne di ba kǝr abɛ di abai tar agǝga kɔka atiŋɛ kuŋkun kɔka kiki iyi tɔ ne mimi; ama abɛ zǝ atu anere abaŋ ndi ba yi nǝ ngir kɛ Arik nenu ti amen ba. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Bane nǝk adamgbyaŋa mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ŋlɔk aneshir ba, ama abɛ sak ba iyah iyi ihwa tuŋ. Fe ilɔ iyi sak iyah mǝne itei yi ndi ilɔ iyi tar ilaŋ. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Nǝ min kɛ ihwa tuŋ ma atei wɔb te aba bɛ ku, ama ba tei yik kɛ ba; atei wɔb tǝ aba abɛ ku, ama iku itei klu ba.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Adamgbyaŋa ayi ndi anǝ ŋa abaŋ ndi ne nyak ba abe tǝ ikum; Ne atu amine ne su ikinuŋ ndi itu anku ikǝ zineriya, fe ati amǝne ne ru ati aneshir. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Fumfuk tu mǝne iyi ndi iye amba, aŋin amǝne ayi ndi aŋin zaki. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Asa amene ne kue nǝ kinuŋ ndi apǝpǝ anǝ zɔb, fe igu iyi bwak ne amgba mǝne iyi ndi igu ntsan anǝŋa tetɛk te gbur ki sa men te gar ikum. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Ayi ne bǝbɛ te atar ndi anǝlaŋ, fe ne bǝbɛ mǝne ayi nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝ sak aneshir iyah har ihwa tuŋ. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Ayi nǝ itum waŋ ndi agli ba, iwa ayi nǝ bla shar mǝne ndi ayi ngɔŋ ne dudu kǝ yaŋ klɛtu. Isak maa ne aŋa Yahudawa ayi Abadan; ne aŋa Helɛnawa ayi Afoliyon (watɔ &lt;&lt;Ine ŋlɔk aneshir&gt;&gt;).<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Iyah iyi kuti nǝ gayir; fena tɔ, tǝ iyah nuŋ tar na nyɛ.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Ankyak inǝ bla shar Arik ne tani avli mpluŋ maa. fe Mwɔ ikɔr rurɛ njunju iyi zinariya kɛ amkpa anǝ tsik ibaŋ nǝ ti kɛ Arik. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Ikɔrɔ idi inǝ bla shar Arik nǝ tani me, &lt;&lt;Zhɔk abɛ bla shar Arik amɛ nas ndi nɛ kpa ba ne Inǝk ngɔŋ ne Yifiretis me!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Abɛ bla shar Arik amɛ nas ne zhɔk ba;tǝ mkpaŋ kǝŋe ne iber iyiŋɛ iyi ihwa kǝŋe bǝn ise ndi neka nyak tǝ abɛ ŋlɔk ntǝk kǝ ntar kɛ aneshir bɔbɔk. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Ne blam idu anɛr abǝ tei yuŋ aneŋa abɛ kpaakpa ma: ayi azhiin angɔŋgɔŋ amɛ 200,000,000.<verse eid="REV 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Ndi Mnǝ yik ne rim lama ayi aneŋa bǝn abɛ yuŋ bama: Agli adaŋgbaŋ anǝ tǝ ikum asesen ndi ilu iyi ku asa, iyi kpuukpuk teyi ndi ama bula, tena yi ndindilim ndi ilu klikla. Atu anǝ ŋama ne ru atu anǝ zaki, fena ilu rurɛ nunu mǝne, ntsiŋ lilɛn lu klikla. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Ntǝk kǝ ntar kǝ aneshir ne ŋlɔk ba ne aganci ane ntar ayuŋɔ: ilu, ntsiŋ, ben lilɛn lu klikla ndi irurɛ nunu mǝne. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Tǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ aneŋa ma iyi nǝ nunu mǝne tǝ vuŋ bǝbɛ mǝne. Ibǝbɛ mǝne iyi ndi anǝwa iyi yi netu, ai yi aŋlɔk anɛshire.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Nki anɛshire, bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi bane ŋlɔk ba ne aganci me, ne kyak iwɔb ta zhɔk ne kiki iyi sub ne aŋɔk amen. Bane duŋ zukur shetan ba, bǝn arik ayi na ne azurfa, zinariya, mimi, mkpaŋ bǝn kuŋkun ndi ba yik ba, ba wɔ ba, kɔ ibǝ lu tsǝn. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />kɔka abɛdi aba atei wɔb zuk zhɔk ne ŋlɔk aneshir, ina ku ayi, ibubu iyi kur bǝn amba kɔ alulum, kɔ izhib men.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ine bla shar Arik ben mplɛ cɛr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Fe myik ngɔŋ nuŋ ne bla shar Arik azǝ are shu. Akpa ne ku, adar ne goŋ tu maa ari; iti maa iyi ndi laŋ arik. bǝn aza amaa ayi ndi akukɔŋ ayi ta lu. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Agli ivǝ mplɛ cɛr ikɛ bu ne ŋɔk maa. Ne sak iza maa ikɛ ŋɔk li ne inǝk ngɔŋ te sak iza maa kɛ ŋɔk mla ne goŋ abɛm, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />fe azho ne kɔr ngɔŋ fe igu maa iyi ndi izhin ane zaki. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Ndi ne naga alɛ aklɛ, Mku ndim ncɛr. Fena mwɔ ikɔr ilɛ ire gbarshu, &lt;&lt;Ku iki me taŋgba yiŋɛ ndi nnas ne blai nyak, kǝr ubǝ cɛrǝ sak ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Fe ine shar ayou Arik ndi Mne yigu ne inǝk ngɔŋɔ ben igɔŋ abɛm alǝk ŋɔk li maa agli ne ishu <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />te asherim ne sak kɛ Arik, waŋ ndi ayi tsetser ne yaŋ klɛtu ben iyaŋ klɛtu, iwaŋ ndi nena igbarshu, igɔŋmimi, ben inǝk ngɔŋ ben kiki yiŋ ndi iyi ne miŋe. Ineshar ayou Arik adi, &lt;&lt;Ba tei na baŋ mkpaŋ ba! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Ama ndi ne bla shar ayou Arik ine taŋgba ate vli mpluŋ maa, fe Arik atei duŋ iki yi kpa nyak maa bǝ shaga, ndi ne mǝne bla abɛ bla shar tɔ ti amaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Fena ikɔr keŋ ndi Mne wɔ kɛ ayi kǝ rɛ gbarshu te tara lɛ bene bɛm, tedi, &lt;&lt;kɔmɔ tǝ ta mplɛ kǝ cɛr keŋ ndi ne bu kǝ teyi ne ŋɔk kɛ ine shar ayou Arik ne klikli ne inǝk ngɔŋ ben igɔŋ abɛm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Fena Mgar ben ine shar ayou Arik te rib bu abɛ nǝm ivǝ mplɛ cɛrǝ. Adim, &lt;&lt;Takɛ te ta kɛ; itei lɛk ne nnɛ mi, ama nenu ami itei men ndi ntun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Mta ivǝ mplɛ cɛrǝ ne ŋɔk kɛ ine shar ayou Arik te nta kǝ, fe ikam men ndi ntun ne anu amuŋ. Ama ndi mne mli kɛ, ikam lɛk ne nnɛ muŋ. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Fena ablam, &lt;&lt;Tedi utei bla tɔ ti iyi shar ilɛ kɛ Arik ne ntun, aner, aŋa ben atum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Aner ayaa ndi neyik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Ine shar ayou Arik ne nǝm mkpɔk ki ikɛyi ndi izɔb kɛ tsar gab, te dim, &lt;&lt;kɔmɔ te tsar gab iyi akaba ayou Arik ben bagedi, te bla idu aneshir abaŋ ndi ayir amkpa ane ku ayi ne akaba. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Ama duŋ tsar ŋakɛ abɛm ba, te nɛ nǝk abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba. Atei lɔ acaŋ ntun tsetser ngɔŋ iyi Urshelima ihwa me sɔknas ane yaa. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Mtei shar aner amuŋ amɛ ayaa abɛ klɛ ne duŋ ne kluŋklu yi zhin ku, fena atei na du ilɛ kɛ Arik ne bɛr 1,260.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Aner abɛ klɛ amɛ ayaa ma ayi atiŋ kuŋkun zetun amɛ yaa ben ibitila abɛ laŋ amɛ yaa ndi aklɛkli ne ti kɛ Ŋgɔŋ ne gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Abɛ te zor anuŋ atedi aba atei cɔk ba ala, ilu rurɛ nunu mǝne te goŋ abɛ te ba izor o; neme iwaŋ ndi atedi wa awɔb ŋlɔk ba atei ŋunu. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ku gbarshu te duŋ alu batei ku ba ne mkpaŋ kɛ zen du ilɛ kɛ Arik mǝne. Ana yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ kam amashir ane tuk, ikam te azhizhi; ana yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ shur ilɔ kaaŋkaŋ ne gɔŋmimi ne ta nyɛmɛ men.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Ndi ne bla ishar du ilɛ mǝne aklɛ, inarum ngɔŋ iyi nek sisik irurɛ idudu ikɛ yaŋ klɛtu te ikum bene beba. Atei klik anaŋ ba te ŋlɔk ba, <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />fe akum amene atei kur ne ankɔŋ ane ntun ngɔŋ, ne amkpa awaŋ ndi ne akpaŋ Ŋgɔŋ amen ne kuŋkun kɛ gen. Iki ndi isak kɛ ntuno azhɔkǝ te Sodɔm, kɔ Masar. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Aner abɛ rɛ ntuntun, aŋa, imwen, ben ŋli atei tɔ akum amene iber me tar ne nki fe batei ta anyɛ me tǝ bɛ ru akum amene ba. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Aner abɛ gɔŋmimi atei nyɛr te aner ayaa ayuŋɔ ne ku. Atei na igyaŋ te shar akpa ne kiki, te aner ayaa abɛ na ndum Arik ayuŋɔ ne sak aner iyah ne gɔŋmimi.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Ndi iber me tar ne nki ite gayir ivli tsetser ikɛ rɛ ben Arik itei yir miŋ kpa mǝne, fena alu aklɛ adidik; fe abaŋ ndi ne yik ba akɔ te isisik. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Ankyak aner ayaa abɛ bla ilɛ kɛ Arik awɔ ikɔr ngɔŋ ire gbarshu te diba, &lt;&lt;Nye zhin ayaŋ!&gt;&gt;. Ndi abɛ te zor amene atɔ, akɔ kɔmɔ ne gbarshu ne min akpa.<verse eid="REV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Anenen ne kpaŋa igɔŋ mimi ne jaŋ; iŋa kɛ ntun ngɔŋ ne zǝr, fǝ ne ŋlɔk aner amkpik amɛ ataŋgba. Nki aneshire isisik ne vuŋ ba tǝ nɛ gbar ŋgɔŋ kɛ Arik ane gbarshu.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Iki iyi nek sǝsǝk iyi yaa ne gayir, iki iyi nek sǝsǝk iyi ntar batei baŋ mkpaŋ ba te nyɛ.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpluŋ kɛ taŋgba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Ankyak ine bla shar ayou Arik ine taŋgba avli mpluŋ maa, fena akɔr angɔŋgɔŋ ne gbarshu, tedi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">&lt;&lt;Ikɔb ngɔŋ kɛ gɔŋmimi ne kam yi ikɔb ngɔŋ kɛ Arik Ŋgɔŋ amɔr ben Kristi ine hria amaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">Atei gli aneshir iyaŋ klɛtu.&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Fena anuŋkub sɔk yaa ane nas ma, ndi akɔsɔŋ ne mben men ne ti kɛ Arik, azekur te nek Arik ngɔŋ maa, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />Tedi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">&lt;&lt;Ta nek inyɛr ne atu ami, Ŋgɔŋ Arik Ŋgɔŋ bɔbɔk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Uyi waŋ ndi U men yime</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">Tǝ nayi waŋ ndi Ukusɔŋ ne mbɛn yi Itum mi.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Aner abɛ kyak zeu ne ntuntun ne te mfu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">Te mkpaŋ kɛ te mfu mi ne nyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Mkpaŋ ne nyɛ kɛ te abɛ ku ŋas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">Tena nek abɛ nau gen abɛ bla tɔ ti ami idǝk men</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Bǝn abɛ zeu te vuŋ abaŋ ndi ne nek sak mi ŋgɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">Ivǝtsob biŋ ngɔŋ iki zhiin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Mkpaŋ ne nyɛ ikɛ ŋlɔk abaŋ ndi ne aŋlɔk aner abe gɔŋmimi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Ankyak akaba ayou Arik ne bu ne gbarshu, fena ne miŋ kɛ akaba amaa neyik amgbɔk lɛ ikɛ kpa nyak. Fe akɔ yik ilaŋ lulu, itsǝk nas tetɛk, igɔŋmimi ne jaŋ ben mkpaŋ alu ngɔŋgɔŋ.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" pubnumber="Iwa bǝn tsetsaŋ" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Fena ikinuŋ ngɔŋ yi nek sisik munru ne gbarshu. Ne mwɔ iwanuŋ, iwaŋ ndi iduŋ maa ai arik ane laŋ, ben ihwa ne angus aza maa ben itu anku kɛ andǝs amɛ awur ane yaa ayi ne tu maa. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Ba tei baŋ mkpaŋ ba te ŋli, ŋli kɛ lɛn susun te aŋu aŋin te zhin mgbɔmgbɔŋ.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Ikinuŋ ngɔŋ iyi nek sisik imunru ne shu. Ayi tsetsaŋ sesen ngɔŋ iye ne atu amɛ taŋgba ben nju me wur ben itu anku ne kɔte tu takɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Nǝ bǝbɛ maa ne gbur andǝs ntǝk ntar ne miŋ kɛ andǝs se atibe ne shu te tur ba shur ne gɔŋmimi. A klɛ ne ti kɛ iwama, te wa abɛ ta vǝvǝn amaa waŋ ndi ate naga ŋliu. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Fena aŋli vǝvǝnlum, iwaŋ ndi atai gli ntuntun bɔbɔk ne asanda ne zɔb. Ama ne kyer vǝvǝne ata aglii Arik ge ne mben yi ngɔŋ maa. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Iwama abwak akɔmɔ ne ahwaŋa ndi Arik ne nau anyagu, ndi atei amɔ bɛr 1,260. <verse eid="REV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Fe ikum iku zhaku ne shu. Mikel ben abɛ shar amaa atsik mgbu ben iwah mimin iyi zhɔ te tsetsaŋ, ndi iyi na tsik mgbumɔ ben abɛ shar amaa; <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />ama nɛ tsik tsetsaŋ anaŋ, fe iwa bǝn abɛ shar amaa ne yar ba agleru nǝ shu. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Iwah ngɔŋ nuŋ yi zhɔ te tsetsaŋ abaŋǝ atyak azhɔk ndi ne men yime ire kukub, azhɔi te shetan, kɔ ne shetan, ndi alɔm aner abɛ gɔŋmimi. Ne tyagu azhɔk ne gɔŋmimi, ben abɛ shar amaa bɔbɔk. <verse eid="REV 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Ankyak Mǝ wɔ ikɔr ngɔŋ ne shu idi, &lt;&lt;Azizaŋa ita zhɔk iye Arik ne nyɛ! Azizaŋa Arik atsar klik maa iyi Tum! Azezaŋa wa Mezaya maa atsar ngɔŋ maa! Tǝ iwaŋ ndi ne klɛ ne ti kɛ Arik te zor ben abɛ zǝ Arik ne bu ben aririk ne tyagu azhɔk are shumɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Ne li ikum ne atu amaa ne azhizhi ayou nklu ben ilɛ didik ndi ne kli me; tena nek atu ben iku. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Nǝ yiŋɛ nyɛr zhin, izhineba ishu ben kiki yiŋ ndi iyi ne miŋe! Ama iyah ne vuŋ zhine ba abɛ gɔŋmimi ben inǝk ngɔŋ! Tǝ shetan ne zi anyɛ ben abɛ zhin, anyɛ ne mfu ngɔŋ, ne zhi te mkpaŋ maa ne dǝk watsɔb.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ndi iwa ngɔŋ iyi zhɔ te tsetsaŋ ne zhi te ne tyak wa azhɔk ne gɔŋmimi, akɔ yar iwa waŋ ndi ne ŋli vǝvǝn lumɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Arik ne nek iwama amgba ayaa aye akuntuk tǝ bɛ bwak te kɔmɔ ne ahwaŋa ngɔŋ, te bɛ yɔk tu maa amɔ ase tar ne nki, te lieru ne aŋɔk ayi daragɔnɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Fena nenu amaa tsetsaŋ aser amashir anca te abɛ ku iwama te baŋu azhɔk adɔmɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Ankyak mimi izɔk iwama; ibu anu te mli amashir awaŋ ndi ne ru are anu tsetsaŋ. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Mfu ngɔŋ ne vuŋ tsetsaŋ ne atu ayi iwama te kama gar ben nki nga ŋli kɛ iwama, bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi azǝ ilɛ kɛ Arik tena klɛ mgbamgbaŋ ne zub yiŋ ndi tane tei ben Yesɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Fe tsetsaŋ aklɛ ne kɔtɔŋ nek ngɔŋ.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Ina rum iyi sisik me yaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Fena Myik inarum ngɔŋ imunru rɛ min inǝk ngɔŋ. Iyi ne njunju me wur ben atu amɛ ataŋgba; kɔte nju takɛ iyi ne tu anku, fe kɔte tu takɛ iyi ne sak keŋ ndi ba iyik ngɔŋ kɛ Arik ba. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Inarumɔ iyi ndi ici, aza amaa ana yi ndi aza inarum ngɔŋ iye ahwaŋ ben anu amaa ana yi ndi anu akɛ zaki. Idaragon o anǝk inarum ngɔŋɔ iklik maa, ben mben yi sɔŋ maa, ben mgbyamgbyaŋ maa. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Itu zhiin ne min kɛ inarumɔ ayi ndi ne taru ngɔŋ, ama mkpaa ma neka rɛ. Igɔŋ mimi bɔbɔk ne vuŋ anu te zǝ inarumɔ. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />kɔte ŋɔ azekur daragon te nɛ nǝk inarum ngɔŋɔ mgbyamgbyaŋ maa. Azekur inarumɔ menyi, tedi,&lt;&lt;Ŋɔwa ayi ndi inarumɔi? Ŋɔwa atei tsik mgbu ayir bene bɔu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Aduŋ inarumɔ ilik tu kɛ te Arik zor, tena duŋu ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ihwa wur ane yaa. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Akɔ zen te Arik mla, ben isak maa, ben amkpa ane yime amaa, ben bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi ayime ne gbarshu. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Ne nǝge mkpaŋ kɛ te ikum ben aner abɛ Arik te abɛ li kum ne atu amene, tena nek mgbyamgbyaŋ ne atu aye aŋa, ntun, aŋa ben aner. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Bɔbɔk aner abɛ gɔŋmimi atei zǝkurǝ, teduŋ se abaŋ ndi ne mǝne acɛr asak amene te ashe alɔ na gɔŋmimi ne mplɛ cɛr kɛ abɛ yi atsitsir ndi ayi abɛ Ŋklu waŋ ndi ne ŋunu ma. <verse eid="REV 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />&lt;&lt;Wɔ, fena, iwaŋ ndi ate yi ne atɔŋ! <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Iwaŋ ndi amene yi neka vuŋ atei ka vuŋu; iwaŋ ndi aneka yi ne ŋun ne anzigba bai lieru ba ai ŋunu. Izhɔ iyiŋɛ iyi vuŋ kpa ben itanyɛme ne ŋa kɛ aner abɛ zǝ Arik.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Fena Mna yik inarum nuŋ, ndi irurɛ gɔŋmimi. Iyi ne njunju me yaa ndi njunju yi ŋklu, fena ilɛ ndi idaragon. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Igli mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ inarum iyi kuti ne yime maa. Isak gɔŋmimi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ben aner atsitsir abɛ gɔŋmimi bɔbɔk abɛ azekur inarumɔ, iyiŋ ndi mkpaŋ maa neka rɛ. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Inarum ngɔŋ iyi yaa ma nena kiki goŋgɔŋ iyi vuŋ anu; iduŋ ilu rurɛ gbarshu te nyɛ gɔŋmimi ne tu kɔte ŋɔwa. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Ankyak iku lɔm aner atsitsir bɔbɔk ndi ayi ne gɔŋmimi ne kiki iyi vuŋ anu iyiŋ ndi nena te bǝ yi amɛ ne ti kɛ inarum yi nek sisik iyi kuti me. Inarumɔ bla ba te abɛ mee izhu iyi ka nek ngɔŋ kɛ inarum iyiŋ ndi anzigba ane tsɔmu azhɔk mkpaŋ ama bane ku ba. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Arik ne nek inarum yi nek sisik iyi yaa ma ne duŋǝ fuk ivli ashur izhu yi mee me te bǝ lɛ te ibǝ ŋlɔk bɔbɔk aneshir abaŋ ndi ne kyak zǝ kuu ma. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Inarumɔ iduŋ aner, amɔ tsɔtsɔb ben angɔŋgɔŋ, abɛ adudunki ben abɛ yaŋǝ, agɛn ben abaŋ ndi ba yi agɛn ba, ne mgbyamgbyaŋ aduŋ asak ba alǝla ne la ŋɔk kɛ li kɔ ne anuti amene. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Inuŋ bai lɛb ba kɔ abɛdi iwa atei baŋa lɛb ne yaŋ ngir ba, watɔ, isak kɛ inarumɔ kɔ icɛre igli sak maa, <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Iyiŋɛ ai zhɔ iyi hria ayi. Iwaŋ ndi ate yi mgbemgbebɛ atei zhi nkan lɛ iyi bla cɛr iyi inarumɔ, te cɛr blama ai sak kɛ nuŋ. Iblama iyi 666.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Ŋklu mɔ ben aneshir amaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Ankyak Mtɔ, te yik Nklu aklɛkli ne gbu iyi Siyona; bene bɔu ayi aner 144,000 abaŋ ndi agli sak maa bǝn kɛ Tetɛɛ amaa ndi ne cɛr kɛ nenu ti amene. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Fena Mku wɔ ikɔr ire gbarshu te glɔ ndi igu amashir mvuŋ, ndi ŋur inas. Iglɔ ndi aneshir aŋur asem ne ntentaŋ iyi na men. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Aner 144,000 ma aklɛ ne ti kɛ mben, iki tsitsir me nas ma, bǝn anuŋkubɔ; azǝn duk asem ayayas, aye ba ankyak ne zhi asɔmɔ. Nǝ yime iyi neshir ne gɔŋmimi aye ba ankyak ne ta ba azhɔk. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Aye alulum abaŋ ndi ne gli atu amen mgbamgbaŋ iyaŋ rik ne yaŋ vu amba kurɔ; bane zhi amba ba. Azǝ Nklu mɔ agar kɔte me. Ne ta ba azhɔk ne sik kɛ sɔŋ aneshir ben abɛ kuti nek Arik ben Nklu atu amen. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Bane zhi ba ne timu ba; ba ne lalɛ ba.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abɛ shar ayou Arik amɛ tar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Fe Myik ine shar Arik nuŋ abwak akɔmɔ ne shu gbagbaŋ, te gli ilɛ kɛ yaŋ klɛ kɛ men te abɛ bla anɛr abɛ gɔŋmimi, te vuŋ ntun, aŋa, ben aneshir. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Adi ne kɔr ngɔŋ &lt;&lt;Nǝk Arik ŋgɔŋ tena gbar ngɔŋ maa! Tǝ mkpaŋ ne teu te abɛ tǝ aneshir bɔbɔk ŋas. Zǝkur Arik waŋ ndi ne na igbarshu, igɔŋmimi, inǝk ngɔŋ, ben ankun amashir!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Ine shar ayou Arik ne yaa azǝ nǝ kuti me, tedi,&lt;&lt;Nǝ ka zhaku! Ntun ngɔŋ iyi Babila ne zhaku! Nǝ duŋ aneshir bɔbɔk asɔ iki rǝrǝ iyi klik iyiŋ ndi ai bubu yi baŋ ayi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Inǝ shar Arik ne ntar azǝ ne yaa, tedi nǝ kɔr ngɔŋ, &lt;&lt;Abaŋ ndi ne zekur inarum yi nek sisik bǝn izhu maa tena ta icɛr iyi sak nenu ti kɔ abɛ cɛr asak ne ŋɔk men <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />aba menyi atei so ne mfu kɛ Arik, mfu ngɔŋ maa, ikeŋ ndi ne bwa kɛ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ mfu maa! Bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi ana kiki mimin yiŋɛ atei gɔŋ ne miŋ lu kɛ yaŋ rim ne ti kɛ abɛ shar Arik atsetser bǝn Nklu mɔ. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Ntsiŋ lu iyi zen gɔŋ bama ilu kɔmɔ ne gbarshu yaŋ klɛtu. Ba sik iyime ba aririk ben ibu ne atu abaŋ ndi ne zekur inarum ngɔŋ yi nǝk sisik bǝn izhu maa, te vuŋ abaŋ ndi ayi ne cɛr iyi sak maa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Izhɔ iyiŋɛ iyi vuŋ kpa ne gar kɛ anɛr abɛ zǝ Arik, abaŋ ndi azǝ ilɛ kɛ Arik te na ididik ne zǝ Yesɔ.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Fena Mwɔ ikɔr ire gbarshu te di, &lt;&lt;Cɛr iyiŋɛ: Inyer iyi ne tu abaŋ ndi ibaŋ rɛ azizaŋa ate ku ne miŋ kɛ zǝ Arik Ŋgɔŋ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">&lt;&lt;Nǝ yeme!&gt;&gt; Izhu tsetser isaga. &lt;&lt;Atei wɔ men kɛ sɔŋ sik nǝ ndum ngɔŋ kɛ na men, te ki yi naa men izǝ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iser kiki iyi gɔŋmimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Ankyak Mtɔ, te yik akpa aklikla, fena ine sɔŋ ne tu mɔ ayi ndi ineshir, ne su itu anku ikɛ azurfa ne tu maa ben alibzi ane lii ne ŋɔk maa. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Fe inǝ bla shar ayou Arik nuŋ aru are akaba te ŋar zhin ne kɔr ngɔŋ igar bǝn iwaŋ ndi akɔsɔŋ ne akpa, &lt;&lt;Gli alibzi ami te sɛr kili ye ahwaŋa, tǝ mkpaŋ neka tǝ; igɔŋmimi neka rǝ te kɛ sɛr!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Fena iwaŋ ndi akɔsɔŋ ne akpa ma ames alibzi amaa ne gɔŋmimi, te igɔŋmimi ne rǝ te sɛr.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Fe Mku yik inǝ shar ayɔu Arik nuŋ aru are akaba ne gbarshu, fe te ana gli alibzi ane li.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Fena inǝ shar ayou Arik nuŋ, ndi iwa ayi ngɔŋ ne tɔ lumɔ, aru are bagedi. A tsaŋ ne shar ayou Arik ndi agli alibzi ane li me ne kɔr ngɔŋ, &lt;&lt;Naa ndum ne alibzi ami, te sɛr idɔ atiŋ akuŋkun ayi ahwaŋa ane gɔŋmimi, te idɔmɔ neka te sɛr!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Ankyak inǝ shar ayou Arik ames alibzi amaa ne gɔŋmimi, aser idɔ agbar ayi ŋguŋgu mɔ, te tugǝ ashur ne nena kɛ kɔk ikɛ mfu ngɔŋ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Ne mwaŋ idɔ agbar ŋguŋgu mɔ ne amagɔŋ ntun, fe azhizhi aru tetɛk itsar ilak maa ne te igab 300 bǝn iklɛ maa itei yi gab aza tuŋ.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Abɛ shar ayou Arik ben kiki iyi sak iyah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Fe Myik gbarshu tǝ yik ikinuŋ yiŋɛ iyi nǝk sisik, ngɔŋ bǝn ivuŋ anu. Abɛ shar ayou Arik amɛ taŋgba bǝn kiki iyi sak iyah me taŋgba, ndi iyi klɛtu, te ai yi bla klɛtu mfu kɛ Arik.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Fe Mku yik ikinuŋ ndi inǝk ngɔŋ ine glas ne cɔk abiŋ ne lu. Mna yik abaŋ ndi ne li kum ne atu inarum ngɔŋ iyi nek sisik bǝn izhu maa bǝn atu abaŋ ndi ne duŋ acɛr asak amene. Aklɛkli ne inǝk ine glas ma, agli tentaŋ iyiŋ ndi Arik nɛ nek ba <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />tɛ duk asem ayi duk Musa, igen ayou Arik, bɛn asem ayi Nklu mɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">&lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ Arik Ŋgɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Iyik ngɔŋ mi bǝn kiki iyi vuŋ anu iyi na mi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Itum anǝ ntuntun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Iyik izub bǝn ididik iyi nkɔŋ mi!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Ŋɔwa atei kli nǝ yime mi, Ŋgɔŋ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Ŋɔwa atei kyak bla ngɔŋ mi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Uyi tsetser kiki mi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Ntuntun bɔbɔk atei nyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Te zekuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Ne kiki iyi na mi iyaŋ klɛtu ndi ne yigǝ bɔbɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Ndi iyiŋe nǝ gayir Myik akaba nɛ bu ne gbarshu, bǝn ivǝn ki nuŋ ne miŋe. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Abɛ shar ayou Arik amɛ ataŋgba ndi agli kiki iyi nek sisik aru are akaba ma, nɛ duŋ ne kluŋklu klikla bǝn ŋa anklu akɛ azurfa nɛ kpa kǝ ne asa amen. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Fena izhiin ne min kɛ ki tsitsir me nas inǝk abɛ shar ayou Arik amɛ ataŋgba agbǝgba ayi azurfa ndi ahru mfu kɛ Arik, iwaŋ ndi amene yime iyaŋ klɛtu. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Ne akaba ma ntsiŋ ne shaga iyi nek ilik gli bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik, te inuŋ ba atei yir miŋ akaba ma ba se kiki iyi sak iyah me taŋgba ne agli anyɛ me ne aŋɔk abɛ shar ayou Arik amɛ ataŋgbama nyɛ klɛtu.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="ms">Agbǝgba ayi mfu kɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Fe Mwɔ ikɔr ngɔŋ ire akabaŋkɔŋ te di abɛ shar ayou Arik ataŋgba: &lt;&lt;kɔte kam zhin agbǝgba ataŋgba ayi mfu kɛ Arik ishur ne gɔŋmimi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Inǝ shar ayou Arik ne kuti te kama gbǝgba maa ashur ne gɔŋmimi. Ankyak iki nuŋ mimin iyi nek iyah imunru bǝn abaŋ ndi ayi ne alǝla ayi inarum ndi azɛkui.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Fe inǝ shar ayou Arik ne yaa akam iki yiŋ ndi iyi ne agbǝgba maa ashur ne nǝk. Amashir ane nǝk akama tǝ ndi azhizhi anɛr abɛ ku.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Inǝ shar ayou Arik ne ntar akam iki yiŋ ndi iyi ne agbǝgba maa ashur ne atuk bǝn mgbashe, amashire akama tǝ azhizhi, ankyak kiki iyi vli ndi iyi ne amashire iku. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Mwɔ inǝ shar ayɔu Arik ndi wa agli amashire adi, &lt;&lt;Iŋas yiŋ ndi une tǝǝ iyi anenen, Uu inǝ yi Tsetser, Uwa waŋ ndi Uyime tǝ na yime rɛ kukub! <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Te aneshir ne tyak azhizhi abeyi tsetser bǝn abɛ bla shar yɔu Arik ahrie, unǝ nek ba azhizhi abɛ ta sɔ. Ne ta iki yiŋ ndi ne tǝǝ ba anenen!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Fe Mwɔ ikɔr ire bagedi tedi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ Arik! Izub bǝn didik mi iyi yi ŋas mi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Ankyak ine shar ayou Arik ne nas akam iki yi agbǝgba maa ashur ne arik, ne duŋɔ awu aneshir ne laŋ maa. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Ne wu ba nǝ nguŋgu kǝ laŋ arik gɔŋ, fe atǝ isak kɛ Arik anu amimin, iwaŋ ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ne atɔ ayi alaga awaŋa.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Fe inǝ shar ayou Arik ne tuŋ akam iki yi agbǝgba maa ashur ne mben yi sɔŋ inarum yiŋɛ. Ibu ne ku ikɔb kǝ inarumɔ, ankyak aneshir ne ŋuu alǝlɛn amen ne lɔ akpa amen, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />fe atǝ Arik anishu anu amimin ne lɔ akpa ben ankpaa amen. Neme bane duŋ na zumimin men ba.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Inǝ shar ayou Arik nǝ tani akam iki yi agbǝgba maa ashur ne nǝk ngɔŋ ne Yufireti, inǝk ge akɔ agbur, te bɛ na ankɔŋ aŋyak atum abǝ rɛ amgbalu. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Fena Mne yik izhu mimin me tar iyi ndi anǝ azizar. Izhu mimin irurɛ ne akɛ tsetsaŋa, anu ake inarum ngɔŋ yiŋɛ, ben anu ake abɛ bla ishar yi timu. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Ayi izhu anerim ndi ana iki yi vuŋ anu. Izhu ime itar yiŋɛ iru te gar ben atum abɛ gɔŋmimi bɔbɔk, tǝ bɛ biŋ ba nyak ankpa zhiin nǝ lɛ kɛ te ikum ne ibar ngɔŋ yi Arik Ngɔŋ.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />&lt;&lt;Wɔ zhin! M nye ndi iner ne zhib! Inyer iyi bǝn waŋ ndi asɔŋ ashur atɔŋ tena su anklu amaa atai nyɛr, batei tsin agɔŋ ari mgbawun tena te ishisha ne min du aneshir ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Fe izhu igli atum nyak amkpa zhin ndi azhɔu ne Yahudawa te Amagadɔn.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Ankyak inǝ shar ayou Arik nǝ taŋgba akam iki yi agbǝgba maa ashur nǝ nguŋgu. Ikɔr ngɔŋ rurɛ mben yi tum ne akabaŋkɔŋ, idi, &lt;&lt;Nǝ ka kle!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Ankyak ilu zen laŋ shak amkpa bɔbɔk, ira nas ŋur shak igɔŋmimi, mimi ne na zhaŋ ngɔŋ. Mimi bane zǝne yik zhaŋ gɔŋmimi nuŋ amɛ ba rɛ na ineshir ne gɔŋmimi; waŋa ayi zhaŋ gɔŋmimi mimin bɔbɔk! <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Ntun ngɔŋ ne gab te kpak tar, ntuntun bɔbɔk zir. Arik ne shuzhi Babila ngɔŋ te duŋɔ asɔ iki riri ne kpar atse maa iki rǝrǝ ne mfu maa ngɔŋ. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Agaŋkubgbu ne naŋ adɔ, igbu gɔgɔŋ ne naŋ dɔ. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Mkpaŋ gɔŋgɔŋ, ndi kɔte tayi iluk maa iyi ndi iyi igab azhin amɛ tar nǝ sɔk tun, ne zhaku ire shu ne atu aneshir, te duŋ aneshir ne te Arik anu mimin ne iki mimin ndi ne na, ane yi alaga amimin.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Iwa ne zǝ alulum bǝn inarum ngɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Ankyak izhiin ne min kɛ ataŋgba abɛ shar ayou Arik ndi agli agbǝgba ataŋgba anyɛ ben abɛm te di, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ, te mtei tsa ru ndi atei sak iwa ne zǝ alulum ngɔŋ waŋa iyah, waŋ ndi ntun yuŋɔ ndi ne mei yaŋ amashir tetɛk. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Waŋ ndi atum abɛ gɔŋmimi ne kur ben abɔu, waŋ ndi aneshir abɛ gɔŋmimi ne hwa ne ayi ane zǝ alulum amaa te kur ben abɔu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Fe izhu tsetser ne yir me, ankyak ine shar ayou Arik ne glim te gar zizik ngɔŋ. Ne mwɔ Mniyik iwa maa akɔsɔŋ ne tu inarum sesen ne cɛr asak te yen Arik agɔŋ ari ne kpa maa bɔbɔk; Inarumɔ iyi ne atu amɛ ataŋgba bǝn njunju ime wur. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Iwama a su anklu dindilim, ben asesen, tena duŋ ne iki zineriya, ben mkpaŋ alfama, bǝn iyi yi klaklak. Agli ikparantse kɛ zineriya ne aŋɔk maa ndi kiki mimin ne shaga, idǝk kɛ zǝ alulum maa. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Ne ti maa ne cɛr isak keŋ ndi ne su kiki yir: &lt;&lt;Babila ngɔŋ, iyah ne amba abɛ zǝ alulum bɔbɔk bǝn kiki mimin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Mne yik iwama ne hwa ne azhizhi aneshir abɛ Arik ben abaŋ ndi ne ŋlɔk ba ne zǝ ilɛ kɛ Yesɔ. Ndi mne yigu, mne vuŋ anu ngɔŋ. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Inǝ shar ayou Arik arib me. &lt;&lt;Uvuŋ anu ke nii&gt;&gt;? Mtei blau iki yi suyir yi iwa waŋa bǝn inarum yiŋ ndi igliu, ayi inarum yiŋ ndi iyi ne atu ataŋgba bǝn izuzu ime wur. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Inarumɔ ne bǝn yime tsitsir ama azizaŋa nǝ ka ku; itei nyɛ ne min dudu kɛ ku itei na ku. Aneshir atsitsir abǝ yi ne gɔŋmimi abaŋ ndi asak amene bane cɛrǝ ne mple kǝ asak abe yi atsitsir te shi kuti na gɔŋmimi ba, atei vuŋ anu ndi ate tɔ inarumo. Ine yi tsitsir; ama azizaŋa ba na yi tsitsir ba, ama itei na munru.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Izhi iki yiŋɛ se ne mgbemgbeb bǝn izhi ki. Atu ataŋgba ai igbu me taŋgba, ndi iwama akɔ sɔŋɔ. Anayi atum ataŋgba: <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />atuŋ nǝ min mǝne ne ka zhaku, izhiin ari kɔ sɔŋ nɛ beme, izhiin bane zen anyɛ ba; ntei nyɛ, atei nyɛ gli ba mkpaŋ watsɔb. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Inarum yiŋ ndi ne men yime ama ba na yime ba, ayi itum ne tender ne miŋ atum ataŋgba atei ŋunu.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />&lt;&lt;Njunju ime wur ndi une yige ayi atum amɛ awur ndi bane zen anyɛn ba ba, ndi atei nyen ba te bɛ gli aneshir ndi atum bǝn inarumɔ mkpaŋ watsɔb. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Atum awur abaŋa ilɛ kɛ susun men yi ir zhiin, atei nek inarum yiŋɛ mgbyamgbyaŋ bǝn ngɔŋ men. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Atei tyak ikum bǝn Nklu; ama Nklu mɔ, bǝn abaŋ ndi ayi bǝn abɔu, abɛ zeu ne susun didik, atei li ba ne kumɔ, te iwa ayi Arik ne arik bǝn itum ne atum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Inǝ shar ayou Arik ana dim, &lt;&lt;Amashir ayiŋ ndi une yige, ndi nǝ zǝ alulum waŋa akɔ sɔŋɔ, ai ntuntun, aneshir, ntsan aneshir, bǝn aŋa kaaŋkaŋ. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Njunju me wur ndi une yige, ben inarumɔ, atei te zor ben iwa ne zǝ alulum waŋa; atei ta iki yiŋ ndi ayime ne yi bɔbɔk te duŋu mgbawun; atei ta ina kpa maa tena gɔŋɔ ne lu. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Ai Arik wa ne duŋ asusun amen abɛ na iki yiŋ ndi wa ne duŋ ba nai tena nek inarum yiŋɛ mgbyamgbyaŋ men te abɛ gli aneshir sei ilɛ kɛ Arik ne shaga.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />&lt;&lt;Iwa waŋ ndi une yigu ma ai ntun ngɔŋ ndi igli aneshir abɛ gɔŋmimi bɔbɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Izhaku yi Babila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Ndi iyiŋɛ ne gayir Mnǝna yik inǝ shar ayou Arik nuŋ azǝ arɛ shu. Ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ngɔŋ, bǝn ilaŋ amkpa anǝ yimɛ maa alaŋ aku gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Inǝ shar ayou Arik ge aŋar zhin ne kɔr ngɔŋ: &lt;&lt;Neka zhaku! Babila ntun ngɔŋ ne zhaku! shetan azǝn shigǝ wɔb bǝn izhu mimin; kiki mimin yi rik bǝn aŋliŋlɔ amimin asɔŋ nǝ kpa maa. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Tǝ ntuntun ne sɔ ne ki rǝrǝ maa iki rǝrǝ yi klik iyi te bubu. Atum abɛ gɔŋmimi ne wɔb ina kiki iyi bubu tiŋ bene bɔu, neme abɛ wɔb adudunki ayi gɔŋmimi ne yik nyaŋa ne yik bubu tiŋ maa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Fe Mwɔ ikɔr nuŋ na rɛ shu, tedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">&lt;&lt;Ru zhin, aneshir amuŋ! Ru zhin ne miŋ maa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">Duŋ na zhin ki mimin maa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">Duŋ zhine wu yik ya ne zub mimin maa!<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />&lt;&lt;Tǝ ilalɛ maa nǝ tsik biŋ te tɔm ndi gbarshu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">Ankyak Arik ashu azhi ki mimin iyi na maa.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Izhin bǝ nau ir keŋ ndi na naa zhine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">Naa zhin ne wu inaŋ ki yiŋ ndi ane nai ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">Duŋ agbǝgba ane sɔ amaa abɛ shaga amkpaŋa ayaa ne klik</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">Ndi iki sɔ iyiŋ ndi ne nai anyaak zhin.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Nǝgu iyah ngɔŋ bǝn len susun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">Ndi inǝk ngɔŋ bǝn ir keŋ ndi ane nek tu maa isɔŋ kɛ men.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Tǝ zen bla tu maa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">&lt;Tɔm Mku sɔŋ, iwa ngɔŋ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">Bam yi iwakɔ ba, bam M tei zhi iluk susun ba!&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Ndi amɛ, ne iber zhiin atei shur Babila ilɔ tetɛk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">Ilɔ, iluk susun bǝn izhɔŋ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Fe atei gɔŋu ne lu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">Te Ŋgɔŋ Arik, inǝ teu ŋas, ayi ŋgɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Atum abɛ gɔŋmimi ndi ne ne nǝk atu amen ne zǝ alulum maa bǝn te bubu atei zhin tena zhin ne atu ayi ntun yi Babila ndi ate yik ita lu kǝ gɔŋǝ. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Aklɛ gbagbaŋ, te aklu sisik ir keŋ ndi iyah iyi yik maa bǝ duŋ vuŋ ba ba. Adi, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi iyah ngɔŋ! Iyi nek sisik! Waŋa ayi ngɔŋ ben ntun ngɔŋ iyi Babila! Nǝ mkpaŋ zhiin ne nǝgu iyah!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Abɛ adudunki abɛ gɔŋmimi menyi azhin te lɛn asusun ne atu amaa, te inuŋ ba na lɛb kiki iyi dub mǝne ba; <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />inuŋ ba lɛb azurfa, izineriya, mkpaŋ yi te anyaŋ, iwulu kɛ klak; kluŋklu iyi rɛ, kluŋklu ndindilim, iyi kɔ, bǝn ŋa ŋklu aklikla; bǝn iki iyi sub ne kuŋkun iyi te anyaŋ bǝn ikiki bɔbɔk ndi ne nai ne kuŋkun, idalma, izɔb, bǝn mkpaŋ iyi baŋ ayi; <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />bǝn kiki men iyi sinamɔn, bǝn iki iyi na ya zhi, bǝn iyi vuk ne akliŋklalu, iwurdi, imur, iki rǝrǝ bǝn anyɛ, mumuŋ bǝn alikama, alandɔŋ bǝn awanta, aneŋa bǝn kiki iyi saa, agɛŋ, te bǝn aneshir abe na Arik. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Abɛ Gli iki yi lɛb ne dub adiu, &lt;&lt;Bɔbɔk kiki didik ndi unǝ shur ayi te bǝ yi mi nǝ naŋ dɔ, bǝn adudunki ami bɔbɔk bǝn kiki iyi na nyak mi ne kɔmɔ, fe ba utei na yigǝ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Abɛ dub, abaŋ ndi ne yi abɛ adudunki ne li dub men ne ntun yuŋɔ, atei kli shaan, te aklu sisik iyi gab iyah iyi zen yik maa. Atei zhin bǝn lɛn asusun, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />te di, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ai ki mimin! Iyi te sisik ne atu yi ntun ngɔŋɔ! Nǝ bere aneshir nǝ Babila aduŋ ne kiki yi rɛ tɔ, ndindilim, bǝn anklu akɛ yi kpa maa ikpyɛ, te ku tu maa ne anklu zineriya, mkpaŋ iyi te anyaŋ, bǝn iwulu! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Ankyak ne mkpaŋ zhin adudunki ami bɔbɔk ne dɔ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Bɔbɔk abɛ yi ne agu bǝn abɛ yi ne miŋ agu mɔ, abɛ dene bǝn abaŋ ndi ana ndum te aya ba amɔ, akli shaan, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />te aŋar zhin ndi ne yik ntsiŋ iyi ilu kɛ zen gɔŋ Babila: &lt;&lt;Bane na yik ntun nuŋ ndi ntun ngɔŋ yuŋɔ ba&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Avu ntɔŋ ashur ne atu amen, azhin te lɛn asusun te di,&lt;&lt; Waŋa ayi ki mimin! Ayi ki yi te sisik ne atu ntun ngɔŋɔ! Iwama wa ayi ntunɔ iwaŋ ndi abɛ yi ne agu abɛ dene bǝn nek ngɔŋ te yi ne adudunki! Fe ne mkpaŋ zhin kɔte nii ne naŋ dɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Ubɛ nyɛr igbarshu, tǝ nɛ zir ntun! Ubɛ nyɛr, aner abɛ Arik bǝn abɛ bla tɔ ti nǝ lɛ maa! Te Arik ne cɔk kiki iyiŋ ndi iwama ne naa zhin! <verse eid="REV 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Ankyak ngɔŋ inǝ bla shar yɔu Arik abaŋ mkpaŋ ngɔŋ te tuge azhɔk ne nǝk ngɔŋ, te di, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ai ir keŋ ndi ntun ngɔŋ iyi Babila atei baŋǝ ames a tyak azhɔk ndi ba tei na yige ba iyaŋ klɛtu! <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Asem ayi ŋur tentaŋ bǝn akɔr aneshir, te vuŋ abaŋ ndi avli ayiyaŋ bǝn mpluŋ ba tei na wɔ ba ba! Batei na yik ine na ndum ne idub nuŋ ba; tǝ igu iyi nena kɛ kɔk gɔ ba tei na wɔi ba. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Ba tei na yik laŋ lu bitila bǝn bɔu ba; akɔr abǝ ta iwama bǝn iwa yaya sa ba tei na wɔi bǝne bɔu ba. Kiki iyi tǝ ikum mi bǝn yi iyi klik ngɔŋ ne goŋmimi, te vuŋ ina kiki lɔm aneshir ndi une naa ba te lɔm aneshir bɔbɔk abɛ gɔŋmimi! <verse eid="REV 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Ne nek ntun Babila iyah te azhizhi abɛ bla tɔ ti abɛ Arik bǝn aneshir abaŋ ndi ne ŋlɔk bɔbɔk ne gɔŋmimi.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Ndi iyiŋɛ ne gayir mǝne wɔ ikɔr glɔ ndi ntsan aneshir ne gbarshu, idi, &lt;&lt;Igbar asak yi Arik! ita zhɔk, Inǝk ngɔŋ, bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ iyi kɛ Arik amɔr! <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Izub bǝn anenen ayi ambuk amaa ayi! Ne cɔk iwa ne zǝ alulum ala ndi acɔk gɔŋmimi ala ne zǝ alulum. Arik ne nǝgu iyah te ne ŋun agɛn amaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Ankyak ne ŋar akɔr te di, &lt;&lt;Gbar Arik sak! Ntsiŋ yiŋ ndi ire ilu keŋ ndi ne gɔŋ ntun ngɔŋ ne lu kɔmɔ ne shu yaŋ klɛ tu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Anǝŋkub sɔk yaa ane nas bǝn ikiki yi vli me nas ne zekur Arik, waŋ ndi akɔ sɔŋ ne mben maa. Te di, &lt;&lt;Be yi amɛ! Abɛ gbar Arik asak!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igyaŋ yi kpa ŋa iyi Nklu mɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Ankyak ikɔr ire mben yi tum ne glɔ, te di, &lt;&lt;Gbar Arik amɔr asak, agɛn amaa bǝn aneshir amaa bɔbɔk, angɔŋgɔŋ bǝn amɔ tsɔtsɔb, abaŋ ndi anegu ngɔŋ maa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Fe mǝne wɔ ikɔr ndi ntsan aneshir ngɔŋ, ndi amashir ane gbub, ndi izhin inas. Me wɔ ba di, &lt;&lt;Abɛ gbar Arik asak! Te Ŋgɔŋ, Arik amɔr Ŋgɔŋ, ayi Itum. <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Ta bɛ nyɛr te na mlak nyɛr; Ta bɛ na gbar Ŋgɔŋ maa! Tǝ mkpaŋ neka te kɛ kpa ŋa yi Nklu mɔ, te iwa yayas amaa neka su iki yi kpa ŋama. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Arik ne nugu anklu tsetser akɛ yi klaklak te abɛ su.&gt;&gt; (Anklumɔ ayi iki didik yi na aneshir abɛ Arik.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Fe ine shar ayou Arik adim, &lt;&lt;Cɛr iki yiŋɛ: Nyɛr iyi abaŋ ndi ne zhɔ ba li igyaŋ yi kpa ŋa yi Nklu mɔ.&gt;&gt; Ine shar ayou Arik ana di, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi lǝlɛ didik kǝ Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Ankyak m zhaku ne aza maa te zekuru, ama ne dim, &lt;&lt;Kǝr ubɛ na amɛ ba! Me yi igen ndi wa bǝn abɛ zǝ Yesɔ, bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi ne zǝ ilɛ didik keŋ ndi Yesɔ ne gli kɛ arumɔ. Zǝkur Arik!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="iex">Te ayi lɛ didik keŋ ndi Yesɔ ne gli kɛ arumɔ ayi kɛ ne ne nek abɛ du lɛ maa mgbyamgbyaŋ.</para>
  <para style="s">Ine sa nŋa klikla ma</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Ankyak myik Igbarshu ibu, fe nǝ ti muŋ myik nŋa klikla. Inǝ sau ma azhɔu te Didik bǝn Izub, ate ŋas didik te na te ikum maa. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Ayi amaa ayi ndi aŋɔk lu, ne su atu anku tetɛk ne tu maa. Ne cɛr sak ne tu maa, ba nuŋ ne zhi iki yiŋ ndi ne cɛr ba anak wa kiki maa ne zhi. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Anklu akǝŋ ndi ne su kɛ ne dib kɛ ne azhizhi. Azhɔ sak maa tǝ &lt;&lt;Ilɛ kɛ Arik&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Abɛ kpaakpa abɛ shu azeu, ne su anklu aklikla te sɔŋ sa ane nŋa klikla te su kluŋklu zezen akɛ yi aklikla. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Anzigba ake li aru rɛ anu amaa, akǝŋ ndi atei ŋlɔk aner abɛ gɔŋmimi. Atei gli ba ne mgbyamgbyaŋ maa, atei na ru tsin ne nguŋgu yi fuk ngɔŋ ne mfu ngɔŋ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Ne anklu amaa ne cɛr sak maa ne mbaŋza maa: &lt;&lt;Itum ane atum bǝn Arik ne arik&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Ankyak mǝne yik ne shar ayou Arik aklɛ kli ne arik. Ne ŋar ikɔr ngɔŋ bǝn bɔbɔk aŋliŋlɔ ndi abwak ne shu: &lt;&lt;Izhin bɛ nyɛ biŋ amkpa zhiin ne igyaŋ yi Arik ngɔŋ! <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Izhin bɛ nyɛ te ta ina kɛ atum, angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ kpaakpa, bǝn abɛ kpaakpa, ina kɛ ane nŋa bǝn abɛ sa ba, ina kɛ aneshir bɔbɔk, igen bǝn iven ne kɔb, vǝtsɔb bǝn ngɔŋ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Fe mǝne yik inarum bǝn itum ne gɔŋmimi bǝn abɛ kpaakpa ane tuŋ biŋ te kum iwaŋ ndi sɔŋ asa nŋa bǝn abɛ kpaakpa amaa. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Fe ne vuŋ inarumɔ aku, bǝn abɛ timu te di aba abɛ bla shar Arik ndi ne na ikiki vuŋ anu ne ti maa. (Ne na ikiki yi vuŋ anu yi ne cɔk abaŋ ndi ayi ne ira yi inarumɔ bǝn abaŋ ndi ne zekur izhu yi inarumɔ.) Inarumɔ bǝn abɛ timu tedi aba ayi abɛ shar Arik ne tuk ba bɔbɔk mǝne ashur nǝ dudu lu kɛ lɛn yaŋ klɛtu. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Ne ŋlɔk abɛ kpaakpa amen ne anzigba ndi arɛ anu kɛ iwaŋ ndi sɔŋ sa nŋa; ankyak aŋliŋlɔ bɔbɔk ne ta ina men ndi ne ya ta ma.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Ase Azhin azhiin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Ankyak me yik ne shar ayou Arik azǝ are gbarshu, agli iki bu ankɔŋ ne ŋɔk maa kɛ idudu lǝlɛ kǝ yaŋ klɛtu bǝn atsitsaŋ ayi luk ne aŋɔk amaa. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Ne vuŋ iwa ma, iwa iyi yi asese, iyiŋ ndi ai ishetan, kɔ shetan, te kpau ne atsitsaŋ ase azhin tetɛk. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Ine shar ayou Arik atugu azhɔk ne dudu lǝlɛ kǝ yaŋ kletu, te ku aŋyak, te tarkɛ aku, te kǝr abɛ na lum aneshir abɛ gɔŋmimi ba se ase azhin tetɛk ayige ne gayir. Ndi iyiŋɛ te gayir atei na buu azhɔk mkpaŋ watsɔb. <verse eid="REV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Fe mǝne yik mben yi sɔŋ itum, ben abaŋ ndi akɔ sɔŋ ne mbene nɛ nek ba mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ te ambuk. Mǝne na yik asusun kɛ abaŋ ndi ne ŋlɔk ba atu yi du ilɛ kɛ bla izub ndi Yesɔ ne bui aŋyak andala ndi ayi ilɛ kɛ Arik. Ndi bane zekur inarum kɔ izhu maa ba, bane na duŋ a ŋar ba ira ne anuti amen ben aŋɔk amen ba. Ne kama si te vli te Gli aneshir ndi itum ben Kristi ase azhin tetɛk. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Anki abɛ kumɔ bane lu ba se ndi ase azhin tetɛk ne gayir.) Waŋa ayi kuti ilu aneshir ne bɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Abaŋ ndi te te yi abɛ kuti lu ne bɛ ayi ate nyɛr tena ta anu adidik. Iku kɛ yaa ba yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ne atu amen ba; atei yi abɛ na ndum Arik ben abɛ Kristi, atei na Gli aneshir ben abɔu ase azhin tetɛk. <verse eid="REV 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Ndi ase azhin tetɛk ayiŋɛ ate gayir, ine shar ayou Arik atei zuk shetan azhɔk ne miŋ jaru, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />ankyak atei kama gar igɔŋmimi te kɔte cɔk aneshir abaŋ ndi ne se var ne gɔŋmimi bɔbɔk, waŋa ayi, Gɔg bǝn Magɔg. Shetan atei Gli ba nyɛ amkpa azhin te abɛ tɛ ikum ben abɛ ba, iklɛ Imenɛ iyi ndi ablubluk ayi kɔtɔŋ inǝk. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Ne ŋar ashak gɔŋmimi te na kama ntsan aner abɛ Arik azik bǝn ntun yiŋ ndi anyɛri. Ama ilu ne rɛ igbarshu te gɔŋ ba ŋlɔk. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Ankyak shetan, waŋ ndi ne cɔk ba ma, ne baŋu atyak azhɔk ne lu kɛ dudu lǝlɛ, amkpa awaŋ ndi inarum bǝn abɛ timu te di aba bla ilɛ kɛ shar Arik ne tyak ba azhɔgɔ; fe atei naga yik iyah aririk bǝn ibu yaŋ klɛtu.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ite ambuk ayi klɛtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Ankyak mǝne yik mben yi sɔŋ itum klikla bǝn iwaŋ ndi akɔ sɔŋ aneyi. fe igɔŋmimi bǝn igbarshu inaŋdɔ ne ti maa bane na yik kɛ ba. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Fe mǝne na yik abaŋ ndi ne ku, angɔŋgɔŋ bǝn amuɔtsɔtsɔb, aklɛkli ne iti kɛ Iben yi itu mɔ. Ne bu amplɛ, fe ne na bu mplɛ inuŋ, ayi mplɛ kɛ abɛ atsitsir. Ne te abɛ ku ambuk ne ikiki yi na men, ndi ne cɛrǝ ne amplɛ me. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Ankyak inǝk ne nek abaŋ ndi ne ku ne miŋ maa. Iku bǝn igɔŋmimi ne na nek abɛ ku abaŋ ndi ayi bǝn abɛ ba. Fe bɔbɔk mǝne ne te ba ambuk ne iki yiŋ ndi ne nayi. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Ankyak ne tyak iku bǝn amkpa ne sɔŋ abɛ ku azhɔk ne ibubwar lu. (Ibubwar lu kǝŋe ayi iku kɛ iyah.) <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Iwaŋ ndi ba tei yik isak maa ne cɛr kɛ ne mplɛ kɛ abe yi tsitsir ba atei tyagu azhɔk ne miŋ ibubwar lu kǝŋe.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Ishu yayas ben Igbarshu yayas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Fe mǝne yik Igbarshu yayas ben gɔŋmimi yayas, te Igbarshu kɛ kuti ben gɔŋmimi kɛ kuti ne naŋadɔ, inǝk ne naŋadɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Fe mǝne yik Ntun tsetser, Urshelima yayas, izi rɛ igbarshu ire ben Arik, ana aŋyak anenen, ndi iwa yayas ne duŋ te sɔŋ aŋub ilu maa. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Mǝne wɔ ikɔr ngɔŋ ilɛ irɛ mben yi sɔŋ yi itum idi: &lt;&lt;Azizaŋa ikɔb kɛ Arik iyi bǝn aneshir! Atei yi bǝn abɛba, aba atei nayi aneshir amaa. Arik wa ne tu maa atei na yi ben abɛba, atei yi Arik amene. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Atei yis amayi ne amen bɔbɔk. Iku batei na yime ba, ilɔ susun batei na yime ba kɔ izhin kɔ ilɔ. Ikiki yi ikukub ne naŋadɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Ankyak Arik iwaŋ ndi akɔ sɔŋ ne mben yi itu mɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Neme Mǝne na ikiki bɔbɔk bɛ yi yayas!&gt;&gt; Ne na dim, &lt;&lt;Cɛr yiŋɛ, ililɛ ayi ilɛ didik bɛ na tanyɛme ne kǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Fe adi, &lt;&lt;Ne ka klɛ! Nga Me yi Alfa bǝn Omega, Me yi ne kuti bǝn Iklɛ tu. Iwaŋ ndi ihriɛ iteu me tei nǝgu amashir ane munru ndi anǝk ivli di ba tei ya ba. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Abaŋ ndi atei lieru ate ta iyiŋɛ ben abɛm: Metei yi Arik amen, aba atei na yi amumun amuŋ. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Ama abǝ tǝ sisik, abǝ yaŋ na iki didik, abǝ na iki shisha, abǝ ŋlɔk aneshir, abǝ kur bǝn amba bǝn alulum ndi ba yi amɛn ba, abǝ tǝ amacincii, abǝ zǝ kpok tu kuŋkun, abǝ timu, amkpa amǝne ayi ikɔb lu kǝ ta nǝ dudu ngoŋ, waŋa ayi iku kǝ yaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Urshelima yayas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Izhiin nǝ miŋ kɛ ataŋgba abɛ shar ayou Arik waŋ ndi agli agbǝgba amɛ taŋgba ndi iyah ntǝk taŋgba yi klɛtu ne shaga ne ye ben abɛm tedi, &lt;&lt;ye, metei tsa ru iwa yayas, iwa Nklu mɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Izhu ne glim, fe ne shar ayou Arik abaŋ me te gar itu gbu lǝlɛ. Ne tsar me Urshelima, ntun ndi yi tsetser, izi rɛ gbarshu ben Arik <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />te yi klaklak ne ngɔŋ kɛ Arik. Ntunɔ itsar laŋ ndi jespa, te yi zenzen ndi kreta, <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Ntunɔ yi ne kɔntsin ngɔŋ, lǝlɛ te yi ŋkuŋkɔŋ me wur ane yaa ben abɛ shar ayou Arik amɛ awur ane yaa ndi ablɛ nkuŋkɔŋɔ. Nǝ kuŋkunɔ ne cɛr asak nga ŋli me wur ane yaa kɛ Isrela. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Kuŋkɔŋ me tar iyi ne kɔte gar takɛ: Itar ne atu anzaŋ, itar ne amgbalu, itar ne gar kɛ kab anzaŋ, itar ne gar kɛ kab amgbalu. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Ntsan kɛ ntunɔ ne mɛ kɛ ne tanda kɛ yi ne mkpaŋ me wur ane yaa, ndi ne cɛr asak abɛ zǝ Yesɔ amɛ awur ane yaa. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Inǝ shar ayou Arik ndi ne lɛ bǝn abɛm agli ririk kɛ zineriya kɛ tsar ntunɔ, bǝn inɔkɔŋɔ, bǝn ntsan. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Ntunɔ yi anju anenen, imwe tena tɔm. Ine shar ayou Arik ne tsar ntunɔ ne asanda: itɔm maa neyi igab azhiin angɔŋ ayaa ben azhin amuɔtsɔtsɔb anas itɔm maa bǝn imwe maa iyi anenen. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Ine shar ayou Arik ne na tsar ntsene, itɔm maa neyi aza 216, ir keŋ ndi ne zen tsar ne mkpaŋ men. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Ne me ntsine ne jasfa, ntunɔ nak yi zineriya bɔbɔk, iyi glaŋglaŋ ndi glas. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Itanda kɛ ntsine ne mɛ kǝ ne mkpaŋ yi te anyaŋ. Itanda kɛ kuti ne mɛ kǝ ne mkpaŋ jɛspa, kɛ yaa ayi safaya, kɛ ntar ayi agat, kɛ nas ayi zumurudu, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />ike tuŋ ayi onis, kɛ tani ayi yakutu, kɛ taŋgba ayi kirisolat, kɛ tender ayi bɛril, kɛ teres ayi tɔfas, kɛ wur ayi kirisofaras, kɛ wur ane zhiin ayi tokwas, kɛ wur ane yaa ayi ametis. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Nkuŋkɔŋ iwur ane yaa maa yi lu ulu u, ne na kɔte anɔkɔŋ atakǝ ne nakǝ ne lu ulu u, kɔte anɔkɔŋ atakǝ ne na kɛ ne lu ulu u izhiin. Ikukɔŋ yi zǝ inak yi zinariya ankyak, iglas ne tɔ caŋɔr. <verse eid="REV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Bam ne yik Akabaŋkɔŋ ne miŋ ntunɔ ba, te akabaŋkɔŋ ayi Ŋgɔŋ Arik ben Nklu. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Ntunɔ ba wɔb laŋ arik ba kɔ ihwa, ŋgɔŋ kɛ Arik ilaŋ shak amkpama, fe Nklu mɔ anak ayi ilaŋa. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Aner abɛ gɔŋmimi atei tsin ne laŋ maa, fe atum abɛ gɔŋmimi atei gliu adudunki. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Inɔkɔŋ yi ntunɔ te nak kur bu ire amblimblɛ te gar amgbalu yaŋ ku, te ibu ba tei yime amɔ ba. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Atei gli irɛ bǝn adudunki kɛ aner abɛ gɔŋmimi agliu anyɛ ntunɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Ama iki yiŋ ndi ba yi tsetser ba itei yir ntunɔ, ba nuŋ ndi ana iki yi shisha bǝn timu, anak ayi abɛbaŋ ndi ne cɛr asak amen ne mplɛ abɛ vli atei yir ntunɔ.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Fe inǝ shar ayou Arik atsar me ituk keŋ ndi yi ne amashir anǝ nek vli, ayi glaŋglaŋ ndi karau, ndi agbub are mben yi sɔŋ Arik bǝn Nklu mɔ.<verse eid="REV 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />Tɛ gbub azǝ atsutsu nkuŋkɔŋ yi ntunɔ. kɔte gar tuk takǝ kuŋkun kɛ nek vli iyi me, idɔ amkpaŋ awur ane yaa ne sɛ, mkpaŋ zhiin ne hwa; fe amgba ma ayi na aneshir abɛ gɔŋmimi tǝ duŋ ba rɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Ikinuŋ ndi Arik ne tei anu amimin ba tei na yige nǝ ntunɔ ba. Mben yi sɔŋ Arik bǝn iven Nklu itei yi ne ntunɔ, agɛn amaa atei zekuru. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Atei yik ti maa, atei cɛr sak maa ne anuti amen. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Ibu ba tei na yime ba, ba tei na wɔb iki laŋ ilu ka ilaŋ arik, te Arik Ŋgɔŋ atei yi ilu kɛ laŋ men, fe atei na Gli aneshir yaŋ klɛtu. Yesɔ anyɛ andanda<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inyɛ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Ankyak ine shar ayou Arik adim, &lt;&lt;Ilɛ kǝŋe ai ilɛ kɛ zub abɛ tanyɛme nekǝ. Fe Arik Ŋgɔŋ, waŋ ndi anǝk abɛ bla shar amaa Izhu maa, ne shar ine shar amaa abɛ tsar iki yiŋ ndi itei na andanda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Wɔ!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Me nyɛ andanda! abaŋ ndi azǝ ilɛ kǝ cɛr abɛ shar amuŋ abɛ nyɛr!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Nga, Yɔɔna, me ne wɔ te na yik iki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk. Ndi ne mne klɛ wɔ te na yik iki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk, mǝne zhaku ne aza ayi ne shar ayou arik ndi ne tsar me iki yiŋɛ, me ne tei zekuru. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Ama ne dim, &lt;&lt;Kǝr na amɛ ba! Me yi igen ikpa amin bǝn amunzumin abɛ shar ayou Arik bǝn bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi azǝ ilɛ keŋ ndi ne cɛr kɛ nen mplɛ kǝŋe. Ubɛ zekur Arik!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Fe adim, &lt;&lt;Kǝr ubǝ su ilɛ kɛ bla iki yi nyɛ ne ti iyir ba, te mkpaŋ ne tǝ gbahir ndi ikiki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk itei na. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Ine na zumimin abɛ nak nai, ine na iki mimin abɛ nak nai, ine na iki didik abɛ nak nai, ine tsin tsetser abɛ nak tsǝn tsetser.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Wɔ zhin.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Me nyɛ andanda! Me Gli idǝk te nyɛ, me tei nek kɔte ŋɔwa idǝk maa ne iki yiŋ ndi ne nai. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Nga Me yi Alfa bǝn Omega, inǝ kuti bǝn klɛtu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Abaŋ ndi ne ŋla iki yi su men atei nyɛr te ne mla ili idɔ kuŋkun kɛ nǝk vli te bɛ na zǝ nkuŋkɔŋ te yir ntun. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Ama abaŋ ndi ayi ne igɔŋ abɛm kɛ ntun abɛ na iki mimin bǝn abɛ na ki suyir, abɛ kur bǝn alulum bǝn amba, abɛ ŋlɔk aneshir, abaŋ ndi azǝ kur amkpɔk atukuŋkun, bǝn abɛ timu ne lǝlɛ bǝn na kiki yi mu. <verse eid="REV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />&lt;&lt;Nga, Yesɔ, ne shar ne shar amuŋ te abɛ kɔte bla zhin iki yiŋɛ ne Akabaŋkɔŋ. Me yi nga ŋli kɛ Doda; Me yi ncinces yi laŋ amblimblɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Izhu bǝn iwa yayas adi, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ!&gt;&gt; iwaŋ ndi atei wɔ iki yiŋɛ atei di, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ&gt;&gt; Iwaŋ ndi ihrie teu abɛ nyɛ; te ta amashir ane nek vli ndi me nek, iwaŋ ndi asɔ.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iklɛtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Nga, Yɔɔna, mǝne mgbaŋ iwaŋ ndi ne wɔ ilɛ mplɛ ikiki ndi tei na ne ti: inuŋ ate yaŋ kinuŋ nɛ ki yiŋe, Arik atei nyaŋu iyah men iye aganci anǝ bla nǝ mplɛ cɛrǝ. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Iwaŋ ndi atei tun ikinuŋ atibe ne lǝlɛ yiŋ ndi ne cɛrǝ ne mli kɛ bla iki yiŋ ndi itei na nen ti, Arik atei tun iki yiŋ ndi yi men ne idɔ kuŋkun kɛ nek ivli bǝn ntun yi iyi tsetser, ndi blai ne mplɛ kɛ cɛr kǝŋe. <verse eid="REV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Iwaŋ ndi ne bla lǝlɛ yiŋɛ adi, &lt;&lt;Iyi amɛ! me nyɛ andanda!&gt;&gt; Ibǝ yi amɛ. Nyɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ! <verse eid="REV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Ina iki didik ndi ire bǝn Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ bɛ yi bǝn aneshir bɔbɔk.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>